msgstr "`@pantoken/next` — yon adaptè konfigirasyon Next.js."

#: bundlers/next/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Instructure UI ships ESM packages that Next must transpile (`transpilePackages`), the #1 papercut\nwhen running InstUI on Next. `withPantoken` merges the InstUI packages into that list. Wrap your\n`next.config`, then import `@pantoken/css` in your root layout for the tokens."
msgstr "Instructure UI livre pake ESM ke Next dwe transpile (`transpilePackages`), pwoblèm nimewo 1 lè w ap kouri InstUI sou Next. `withPantoken` entegre pake InstUI yo nan lis sa a. Anvlope `next.config` ou a, epi enpòte `@pantoken/css` nan layout rasin ou pou tokens yo."

