msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Size** controls padding and gap: `relaxed` (default) is roomier; `compact` tightens both.\n  **Color** sets the fill: bare (no modifier) is unfilled — border and icon only; `-color-violet`\n  and `-color-sea` add a tinted background plus a matching icon swatch."
msgstr "**Size** kontwole padding ak espas: `relaxed` (default) pi laj; `compact` sere toude.\n  **Color** fikse koulè ranpli a: bare (san modifikatè) pa gen ranpli — sèlman bor ak ikon; `-color-violet`\n  ak `-color-sea` ajoute yon background ak yon lonbraj ikon ki matche."

#: css/banner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add `role=\"status\"` (or `role=\"alert\"` for urgent messages) so assistive tech announces the\n  banner; mark a decorative icon `aria-hidden=\"true\"` and give the close button an `aria-label`."
msgstr "Ajoute `role=\"status\"` (oswa `role=\"alert\"` pou mesaj ijans) pou teknoloji asistif ka anonse bann lan; make yon ikon dekoratif kòm `aria-hidden=\"true\"` epi bay bouton fèmen an yon `aria-label`."

#: css/banner.md
