#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `.hero`/`.heading`/`.message` parts are composed by the consumer's markup, not enforced structure; `-clickable` only adds hover styling, so a real click target still needs `tabindex` and a keyboard handler."
msgstr "Pati `.hero`/`.heading`/`.message` yo konpoze pa makaj konsomatè a, pa yon estrikti ki fòse; `-clickable` sèlman ajoute stil hover, kidonk yon sib klik reyèl toujou bezwen `tabindex` ak yon handler klavye."

#: css/billboard.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
