msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`li` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — A crumb (InstUI `Breadcrumb.Link`), an `<li>` in the parent's `<ol>`; the last one is the current page."
msgstr "`li` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — Yon crumb (InstUI `Breadcrumb.Link`), yon `<li>` nan `<ol>` paran an; dènye a se paj aktyèl la."

#: css/breadcrumb.link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `breadcrumb`'s `-size-sm`/`-size-lg` modifiers adjust this member's separator spacing — see `breadcrumb`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Modifikatè `-size-sm`/`-size-lg` nan `breadcrumb` paran an ajiste espas separatè manm sa a — wè dokiman `breadcrumb` pou modifikatè sa yo."

#: css/breadcrumb.link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark the current page's crumb with `aria-current=\"page\"` — on its `<a>` if it's a link, otherwise on the `<li>` itself."
msgstr "Mete mak sou crumb paj aktyèl la ak `aria-current=\"page\"` — sou `<a>` li si se yon lyen, sinon sou `<li>` li menm."

