#: css/breadcrumb.link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "In a collapsed parent draws a masked back-arrow before this crumb's second-to-last link."
msgstr "Nan yon paran ki konprese, trase yon flèch retou kache anvan dezyèm-dernye lyen crumb sa a."

