#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: button"
msgstr ""

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-button` — An accessible action control, styled from the token palette; primary by default."
msgstr "`.instui-button` — Yon kontwòl aksyon aksesib, style soti nan palèt token; prensipal pa default."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The AI variants layer two gradients — a padding-box fill and a border-box stroke — for their frame, and `-color-ai-secondary` can't paint gradient text and a fill at once, so its centre stays transparent at rest and fills on hover or active. `-without-background` hover and active derive a low-opacity, slightly-darkened brand wash rather than using the raw hover-background tokens, which would print same-colour-on-same-colour text. Also sets its own icon/label `gap` and horizontal `padding`; chaining a `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides those built-in values. The optional `.instui-button-group` wrapper maps Figma's `.buttonGroup` and owns adjacent button spacing."
msgstr "Variant AI yo gen de gradient kouch — yon ranpli padding-box ak yon koule border-box — pou ankadreman yo, e `-color-ai-secondary` pa ka pentire tèks gradient ak yon ranpli an menm tan, kidonk sant li rete transparan an repo epi li ranpli sou hover oswa active. `-without-background` hover ak active sòti yon lave mak ki gen opasite ba, yon ti kras fè nwa pito pase sèvi ak token raw hover-background yo, ki ta fè tèks la menm koulè sou menm koulè. Epitou mete pwòp icon/etikèt `gap` ak orizontal `padding`; chenn yon modifye spacing `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` ranplase valè entegre sa yo. Wrapper opsyonèl `.instui-button-group` la map `.buttonGroup` Figma epi li posede espas bouton ki toupre."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [button.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/button/button.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [button.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/button/button.css)"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Drive the `-toggle` variant's pressed state with `aria-pressed`, and mark a disabled button with `aria-disabled` (or the native `disabled`)."
msgstr "Kondwi eta peze variant `-toggle` la ak `aria-pressed`, epi make yon bouton enfim ak `aria-disabled` (oswa natif natal `disabled`)."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A group wrapper lays out adjacent buttons with the shared button gap."
msgstr "Yon wrapper gwoup plase bouton ki toupre yo ak espas pataje bouton an."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An AI action."
msgstr "Yon aksyon AI."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A lower-emphasis AI action."
msgstr "Yon aksyon AI ak enpòtans pi ba."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
