msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For a button placed on a coloured (non-neutral) surface. Composed with `-color-primary` (default) fills white with dark text; composed with `-color-secondary` stays transparent with a white border and text."
msgstr "Pou yon bouton plase sou yon sifas koulè (ki pa net). Konpoze ak `-color-primary` (default) ranpli blan ak tèks fonse; konpoze ak `-color-secondary` rete transparan ak yon bord ak tèks blan."

