msgstr ""

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-byline` — A media object: a hero figure beside a title and description."
msgstr "`.instui-byline` — Yon objè medya: yon figi ewo bò yon tit ak yon deskripsyon."

#: css/byline.md
