msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between the figure and the text block; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Mete pwòp `gap` li ant figi a ak blòk tèks la; chenn yon modifikatè itilite espas `-gap-*` ranplase valè entegre sa a."

