msgid "`.--cursor-pointer` — `cursor` as a composable, global class — `.--cursor-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--cursor-pointer`)."
msgstr "`.--cursor-pointer` — `cursor` kòm yon klas mondyal konpozab — `.--cursor-<value>` — kap itilize li direkteman oswa an chèn sou nenpòt konpozan (`.instui-button.--cursor-pointer`)."

#: css/cursor.md
#, no-c-format
