#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: drawer-layout.content"
msgstr "# CSS: drawer-layout.content"

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.content` — The primary content pane that fills remaining space beside the tray."
msgstr "`.content` — Panèl kontni prensipal la ki ranpli espas ki rete bò kote panèl la."

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Once the parent's inline-size drops below `46em` (`16em` tray width + `30em` breakpoint), a `@container` query on the parent's `pantoken-drawer-layout` container drops this member's `min-inline-size` to `0` automatically, matching the manual `[should-overlay-tray]` override."
msgstr "Yon fwa gwosè-inline paran an bese anba `46em` (`16em` lajè tray + `30em` pwen kraze), yon `@container` query sou kontenè `pantoken-drawer-layout` paran an fè `min-inline-size` manm sa a vin `0` otomatikman, ki matche ak sipèpoze manyèl `[should-overlay-tray]`."

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Carry `role=\"region\"` (InstUI's DrawerLayout convention) and name it with `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` when context alone doesn't identify it."
msgstr "Pote `role=\"region\"` (konvansyon DrawerLayout InstUI a) epi nonmen li ak `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` lè kontèks la pou kont li pa idantifye li."

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [drawer-layout.tray](/api/css/drawer-layout.tray.md) — The adjacent panel in the same flex row."
msgstr "- [drawer-layout.tray](/ht/api/css/drawer-layout.tray.md) — The adjacent panel in the same flex row."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: drawer-layout"
msgstr ""

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-drawer-layout` — A split layout with a collapsible side tray and a primary scrollable content pane."
msgstr "`.instui-drawer-layout` — Yon layout ki divize ak yon plat bò ki ka kontrenn epi yon prensipal pan k ap defile."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`-placement-end` and the default (start) both use `flex-direction`/`inset-inline-*` logical properties, not `left`/`right`, so the tray's side follows `direction`/`dir=\"rtl\"` automatically — no separate RTL rules are needed."
msgstr "`-placement-end` ak default (start) toude itilize `flex-direction`/`inset-inline-*` pwopriyete lojik, pa `left`/`right`, konsa bò tray a swiv `direction`/`dir=\"rtl\"` otomatikman — pa bezwen règ RTL separe."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [drawer-layout.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/drawer-layout/drawer-layout.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [drawer-layout.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/drawer-layout/drawer-layout.css)"

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "When the tray acts as navigation, label it with an accessible heading or `aria-label`. Give `.content` `role=\"region\"` (InstUI's DrawerLayout convention) and name it with `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` when context alone doesn't identify it."
msgstr "Lè tray la sèvi kòm navigasyon, make li ak yon tit aksesib oswa `aria-label`. Bay `.content` `role=\"region\"` (konvansyon DrawerLayout InstUI) epi nonmen li ak `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` lè kontèks la pa idantifye li poukont li."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Show the tray even when the `open` attribute is absent."
msgstr "Montre tray a menm lè atribi `open` pa prezan."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dock the tray on the inline-end side."
msgstr "Fè tray a doke sou bò inline-end la."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dock the tray on the inline-start side (the default; sets it explicitly)."
msgstr "Fè tray a doke sou bò inline-start la (default; mete l eksplisitman)."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill pantoken-doc-tag pantoken-doc-tag-interaction\">Interaction</span> — Render the tray as an overlay instead of shrinking content inline."
msgstr ""

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The main pane."
msgstr "Pan prensipal la."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The side panel."
msgstr "Pan bò a."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Width threshold for overlay mode (`30em`, themed via responsive utilities)."
msgstr "Limit lajè pou mòd overlay (`30em`, tèmize atravè zouti reponn)."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- The `drawer-layout.tray`/`drawer-layout.content` members switch to overlay mode automatically via a `@container` query once this element's inline-size drops below tray-width + `--pantoken-bp-md`. The `@pantoken/interactions` behavior additionally toggles `[should-overlay-tray]`/`.-should-overlay-tray` (a manual override) and emits `overlaytraychange` for apps that need the change as an event."
msgstr "- Manm `drawer-layout.tray`/`drawer-layout.content` yo chanje otomatikman nan mòd overlay via yon kesyon `@container` yon fwa inline-size eleman sa a desann anba tray-width + `--pantoken-bp-md`. Konpòtman `@pantoken/interactions` a anplis pèmèt yo kontwole `[should-overlay-tray]`/`.-should-overlay-tray` (yon anile manyèl) epi li emèt `overlaytraychange` pou aplikasyon ki bezwen chanjman an kòm yon evènman."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — A standalone edge overlay; this layout keeps tray and content in the same flow.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — A smaller anchored surface for contextual actions and detail."
msgstr "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — Yon overlay sou kwen ki endepandan; layout sa a kenbe tray ak kontni nan menm flux la.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — Yon sifas ankre pi piti pou aksyon kontèksyèl ak detay."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: drawer-layout.tray"
msgstr ""

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.tray` — The side panel beside main content, with optional overlay and tray-like surface modifiers."
msgstr "`.tray` — Panno bò ki bò kote kontni prensipal la, ak modifikatè opsyonèl tankou kouch sipèpoze ak sifas ki sanble yon tray."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Positioning uses `inset-inline-start`/`inset-inline` (never `left`/`right`), so `-placement-end` docks to the true trailing edge in both LTR and RTL."
msgstr "Pozisyonman itilize `inset-inline-start`/`inset-inline` (pa janm `left`/`right`), kidonk `-placement-end` doke sou bor dèyè reyèl la nan tou de LTR ak RTL."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "If used as navigation, wrap links in a semantic `<nav>` and provide an accessible name."
msgstr "Si li itilize kòm navigasyon, mete lyen yo anndan yon `<nav>` semantik epi bay li yon non aksesib."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dock this tray to inline-end when overlay mode is active."
msgstr "Doke tray sa a sou inline-end lè mòd overlay la aktif."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove the panel edge border."
msgstr "Retire bor panèl la."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove elevation when overlay mode is active."
msgstr "Retire elevasyon an lè mòd overlay la aktif."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [drawer-layout.content](/api/css/drawer-layout.content.md) — The primary pane that flexes alongside this member."
msgstr "- [drawer-layout.content](/api/css/drawer-layout.content.md) — Pan prensipal la ki fleksib epi ki pozisyone bò kote manm sa a."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: file-drop"
msgstr ""

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-file-drop` — A file dropzone with hover, accepted, and rejected states."
msgstr "`.instui-file-drop` — Yon zòn depo fichye ak eta survol (hover), aksepte, ak rejte."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `-hover`/`-accepted`/`-rejected` classes are purely visual — actual drag-and-drop detection and file validation are the consumer's JS to wire up around the wrapped native input."
msgstr "Klas `-hover`/`-accepted`/`-rejected` yo sèlman vizyèl — deteksyon drag-and-drop reyèl ak validasyon fichye se JS konsomatè a pou konekte alantou input natif la."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [file-drop.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/file-drop/file-drop.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [file-drop.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/file-drop/file-drop.css)"

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wrap a native `<input type=\"file\">` in the `<label>` drop zone so it stays a real, labelled file control that the keyboard and assistive tech can operate."
msgstr "Anvlòp yon `<input type=\"file\">` natif nan zòn depo `<label>` la pou li rete yon kontwòl fichye reyèl, make ak etikèt, ke klavye a ak teknoloji asistans yo ka opere."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Drag state for an acceptable file."
msgstr "Eta trennen pou yon fichye ki akseptab."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hover or drag-over state."
msgstr "Eta survol (hover) oswa eta lè trennen anlè (drag-over)."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render the leading dropzone glyph icon."
msgstr "Afiche ikon glif prensipal zòn depo a."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Drag state for a rejected file."
msgstr "Eta trennen pou yon fichye rejte."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: form-field-group"
msgstr ""

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-form-field-group` — A `<fieldset>` group with a legend, a column or inline layout, and configurable spacing."
msgstr "`.instui-form-field-group` — Yon gwoup `<fieldset>` ak yon lejann, yon layout kolòn oswa inline, epi espas ki ka konfigire."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between fields, tunable with the `-col-spacing-*`/`-row-spacing-*` modifiers below — prefer those over chaining a generic `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier, which overrides the built-in value outright."
msgstr "Mete pwòp `gap` li ant chan yo, reglabl ak modifikatè `-col-spacing-*`/`-row-spacing-*` ki anba yo — prefere sa yo olye pou chaine yon modifikatè utilite espas jeneral `-gap-*`, ki ranplase valè entegre a nèt."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [form-field-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-group/form-field-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [form-field-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-group/form-field-group.css)"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders a native `<fieldset>` with a `<legend>`, so the legend text names the whole group for assistive tech."
msgstr "Rann yon `<fieldset>` natif avèk yon `<legend>`, konsa tèks lejann lan bay non tout gwoup la pou teknoloji asistans."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large column gap."
msgstr "Gwo espas kolòn."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium column gap."
msgstr "Mwayen espas kolòn."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "No column gap."
msgstr "Pa gen espas kolòn."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small column gap."
msgstr "Ti espas kolòn."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Align child fields to a shared grid."
msgstr "Alinye chan pitit yo sou yon gri pataje."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay child fields out in columns."
msgstr "Plase chan pitit yo an kolòn."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay child fields inline, in a row."
msgstr "Plase chan pitit yo an liy, nan yon ranje."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark the group as required."
msgstr "Mare gwoup la kòm obligatwa."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large row gap."
msgstr "Gwo espas ranje."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium row gap."
msgstr "Mwayen espas ranje."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "No row gap."
msgstr "Pa gen espas ranje."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small row gap."
msgstr "Ti espas ranje."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Bottom-align the fields."
msgstr "Aliyé chan yo anba (bottom-align)."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Middle-align the fields."
msgstr "Aliyé chan yo nan mitan."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Top-align the fields."
msgstr "Aliyé chan yo anlè."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the decorative required-field asterisk after the legend text when the group is required."
msgstr "Rann astèriski dekoratif 'chan obligatwa' apre tèks lejann lan lè gwoup la obligatwa."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- The `-layout-aligned` mode uses CSS subgrid behind an `@supports` guard; where subgrid is unsupported, the fields fall back to their own stacked layout."
msgstr "- Mòd `-layout-aligned` la itilize CSS subgrid dèyè yon gad `@supports`; kote subgrid pa sipòte, chan yo retounen sou layout pile pa yo."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — The single field this group repeats.\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — Groups radio inputs under a legend."
msgstr "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — Chan sèl gwoup sa repete.\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — Gwoupe opinyon radio anba yon lejann."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: form-field-messages"
msgstr ""

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-form-field-messages` — Field help and validation messages — hint, error, success, and screen-reader-only — with a glyph on error and success."
msgstr "`.instui-form-field-messages` — Mesaj èd ak validasyon chan — konsèy, erè, siksè, ak sèlman pou lektè ekran — ak yon ikon sou erè ak siksè."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between stacked messages; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Etabli pwòp `gap` li ant mesaj ki anpile; chèn yon modifikatè utilité espas `-gap-*` ap ranplase valè entegre sa a."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [form-field-messages.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-messages/form-field-messages.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [form-field-messages.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-messages/form-field-messages.css)"

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `-type-screenreader-only` message is visually hidden but stays in the accessibility tree, so it's still announced; pair error and success messages with the field via aria-describedby so assistive tech reads them with the control."
msgstr "Yon mesaj `-type-screenreader-only` kache vizyèlman men ki rete nan pyebwa aksèbilite a, kidonk li toujou anonse; asosye mesaj erè ak siksè yo ak chan an atravè aria-describedby pou teknoloji asistif li yo ansanm ak kontwòl la."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-type-error`."
msgstr ""

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An individual message; its `-type-*` picks the hint, error, success, or screen-reader-only variant."
msgstr "Yon mesaj endividyèl; `-type-*` li chwazi varyant konsèy, erè, siksè, oswa sèlman pou lektè ekran."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the leading status glyph on error and success messages: an alert circle for errors and a check circle for success."
msgstr "Afiche ikon estati a devan sou mesaj erè ak siksè: yon sèk alèt pou erè e yon sèk ak chèk pou siksè."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — Wraps a label, controls, and these messages."
msgstr "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — Vlope yon etikèt, kontwòl, ak mesaj sa yo."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: form-field"
msgstr ""

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-form-field` — A form-field wrapper: a label, its controls, and inline, required, or readonly layouts."
msgstr "`.instui-form-field` — Yon vlope chan fòm: yon etikèt, kontwòl li yo, ak layout anliy, obligatwa, oswa sèlman-li-lis."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An error message stays hidden until the field's control is `:user-invalid` (after the user interacts) or you add the `-invalid` class. Use `-layout-inline` to put the label beside the controls and `-layout-stacked` to put it above. Also sets its own `gap` between the label, controls, and messages; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Yon mesaj erè rete kache jiskaske kontwòl chan an vin `:user-invalid` (apre itilizatè a entèaji) oswa ou ajoute klas `-invalid`. Sèvi ak `-layout-inline` pou mete etikèt la bò kote kontwòl yo epi `-layout-stacked` pou mete li anlè. Li mete tou pwòp `gap` li ant etikèt la, kontwòl yo, ak mesaj yo; chenen yon modifikatè espas `-gap-*` pral ranplase valè entegre sa a."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [form-field.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field/form-field.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [form-field.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field/form-field.css)"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `<label>` element wraps the control, so the label text names it natively; the required asterisk is decorative and should be hidden from assistive tech (aria-hidden), and the error message surfaces once the control is `:user-invalid` or you add the `-invalid` class."
msgstr "Eleman `<label>` la vlope kontwòl la, konsa tèks etikèt la nonmen li natif natal; estèrik obligatwa a se dekoratif e li dwe kache pou teknoloji asistans (aria-hidden), epi mesaj erè a parèt yon fwa kontwòl la vin `:user-invalid` oswa ou ajoute klas `-invalid`."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline layout (shorthand for `-layout-inline`)."
msgstr "Layout anliy (fòm kout pou `-layout-inline`)."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "End-align the label text."
msgstr "Alinye tèks etikèt la sou fen an."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Start-align the label text."
msgstr "Alinye tèks etikèt la sou kòmansman an."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline layout: label beside the controls."
msgstr "Layout anliy: etikèt bò kote kontwòl yo."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stacked layout: label above the controls."
msgstr "Layout anpile: etikèt anlè kontwòl yo."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Bottom-align the label with the controls."
msgstr "Alinye etikèt la anba menm ak kontwòl yo."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Top-align the label with the controls."
msgstr "Alinye etikèt la anlè menm ak kontwòl yo."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The control area beside or below the label."
msgstr "Zòn kontwòl la bò kote oswa anba etikèt la."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The field label."
msgstr "Etikèt chan an."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the decorative required-field asterisk after the label text when the field is required."
msgstr "Rann estèrik dekoratif ki endike chan obligatwa a apre tèks etikèt la lè chan an obligatwa."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [form-field-messages](/api/css/form-field-messages.md) — Renders the field's hint, error, and success messages.\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — Groups related fields under a shared legend."
msgstr "- [form-field-messages](/api/css/form-field-messages.md) — Rann konsèy, erè, ak mesaj siksè chan an.\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — Gwoupe chan ki gen rapò anba yon legend pataje."

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: gap"
msgstr ""

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--gap-md` — Flex/grid `gap` utilities on the spacing scale, short (`--gap-sm`) or long (`--gap-small`) spelling. Usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — components that already set their own `gap` from a component-specific token may have it overridden."
msgstr "`.--gap-md` — Itiliti `gap` pou Flex/grid sou echèl espas la, fòm kout (`--gap-sm`) oswa fòm long (`--gap-small`). Ka itilize poukont oswa chenn sou nenpòt konpozan (`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — konpozan ki deja defini pwòp `gap` yo soti nan yon token espesifik pou konpozan ka wè li ranplase."

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/gap/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/gap/index.ts)"

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Applies the medium spacing token as the gap."
msgstr "Aplike token espas mwayen an kòm gap la."

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Gap utilities across short and long spacing-step spellings."
msgstr "Itiliti gap pou tou de fòm kout ak fòm long nan etap espas yo."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: heading"
msgstr ""

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-heading` — Heading typography from `-level-h1` to `-level-h6`."
msgstr "`.instui-heading` — Tipografi tit soti nan `-level-h1` rive `-level-h6`."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `-variant-*` presets override a `-level-*`'s font-size and font-weight, so combine only one of each family per element."
msgstr "Preset `-variant-*` yo ranplase font-size ak font-weight yon `-level-*`, kidonk konbine sèlman yon sèl nan chak fanmi pou chak eleman."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [heading.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/heading/heading.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [heading.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/heading/heading.css)"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "These classes set the visual level only, so render a real `<h1>`–`<h6>` (or use `role=\"heading\"` with `aria-level`) to convey the heading level."
msgstr "Klas sa yo fikse sèlman nivo vizyèl la, kidonk rann yon reyèl `<h1>`–`<h6>` (oswa itilize `role=\"heading\"` ak `aria-level`) pou transmèt nivo tit la."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add a bottom rule."
msgstr "Ajoute yon liy anba."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add a top rule."
msgstr "Ajoute yon liy anlè."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "AI-accent colour."
msgstr "Koulè aksan AI."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Primary colour."
msgstr "(default) Koulè prensipal."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On-dark (primary inverse) colour."
msgstr "Koulè sou fon fè nwa (envès prensipal)."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Secondary (muted) colour."
msgstr "Koulè segondè (estompe)."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h1 type scale."
msgstr "Rann nan echèl tip h1."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h2 type scale."
msgstr "Rann nan echèl tip h2."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h3 type scale."
msgstr "Rann nan echèl tip h3."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h4 type scale."
msgstr "Rann nan echèl tip h4."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h5 type scale."
msgstr "Rann nan echèl tip h5."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h6 type scale."
msgstr "Rann nan echèl tip h6."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Label type preset."
msgstr "Preset tip etikèt."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mini card-title preset."
msgstr "Preset mini tit kat."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Regular card-title preset."
msgstr "Preset tit kat regilye."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Card section-title preset."
msgstr "Preset tit seksyon kat."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Page-title preset."
msgstr "Preset tit paj."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Section-title preset."
msgstr "Preset tit seksyon."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text](/api/css/text.md) — Body typography for non-heading text."
msgstr "- [text](/api/css/text.md) — Tipografi kò pou tèks ki pa tit."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: hero"
msgstr ""

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-hero\"]` — Full-width header section with title, subtitle, and optional background image."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-hero\"]` — Seksyon header lajè konplè ak tit, sou-tit, ak imaj background opsyonèl."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Hero when:"
msgstr "✅ Sèvi ak Hero lè:"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- You need a prominent page header with visual hierarchy\n- The page benefits from a large, eye-catching opening section\n- You want to include background imagery or gradient accents\n🚫 Don't use Hero when:"
msgstr "- Ou bezwen yon header paj ki vizib avèk yon iyerachi vizyèl\n- Paj la benefisye de yon seksyon ouvèti gwo ki atire je\n- Ou vle enkli imaj background oswa aksan dégradé\n🚫 Pa sèvi ak Hero lè:"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a simple page header — use Page-Layout instead\n- The hero competes with critical content — prioritize readability"
msgstr "- Wap konstwi yon header paj senp — itilize Page-Layout olye\n- Hero a konpetisyon ak kontni kritik — bay priyorite pou lizibilite"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Ensure the title is in an `<h1>` tag for semantic structure\n- If using background images, provide sufficient color contrast for text\n- Avoid autoplay on video or animation that could distract from content"
msgstr "- Asire tit la nan yon `<h1>` tag pou estrikti semantik\n- Si w ap itilize imaj background, bay kontrast koulè ase pou tèks la\n- Evite autoplay sou videyo oswa animasyon ki ta ka dezoryante lektè a"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hero subtitle content"
msgstr "Kontni sou-tit Hero"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hero title content"
msgstr "Kontni tit Hero"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional action buttons or links."
msgstr "Bouton aksyon oswa lyen opsyonèl."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional background layer (image or gradient)."
msgstr "Kouch background opsyonèl (imaj oswa dégradé)."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Container for hero text and actions."
msgstr "Kontenè pou tèks Hero ak aksyon."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional semi-transparent overlay for text contrast."
msgstr "Kouch semi-transparan opsyonèl pou kontrast tèks."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional supporting text or description."
msgstr "Tèks sipò oswa deskripsyon opsyonèl."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Main hero title (typically `<h1>`)."
msgstr "Tit prensipal hero a (tipikman `<h1>`)."

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: icon"
msgstr ""

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-icon` — The icon system: `.instui-icon` sizing plus the shared `-icon-<name>` painter that masks a glyph (in `currentColor`) before any element."
msgstr "`.instui-icon` — Sistèm ikon an: gwosè `.instui-icon` ansanm ak pent pataje `-icon-<name>` ki kache yon glif (nan `currentColor`) anvan nenpòt eleman."

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [icon.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/icon/icon.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [icon.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/icon/icon.css)"

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The glyph is decorative, so mark it `aria-hidden=\"true\"`; give it a `role` or label only when the icon conveys meaning on its own."
msgstr "Glif la dekoratif, kidonk make li `aria-hidden=\"true\"`; bay li yon `role` oswa yon etikèt sèlman lè ikon an pote sans poukont li."

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Set the glyph token (`--pantoken-glyph`) and render it via the shared painter (for example `-icon-search`)."
msgstr "Mete token glif la (`--pantoken-glyph`) epi rann li atravè pent pataje a (pa egzanp `-icon-search`)."

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The glyph itself: a 1em box masked from `--pantoken-glyph` and filled with `currentColor`."
msgstr "Glif la menm: yon bwat 1em kache soti nan `--pantoken-glyph` epi ranpli ak `currentColor`."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: img"
msgstr ""

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-img` — A styled `<img>` with display, crop, and effect modifiers that stack."
msgstr "`.instui-img` — Yon `<img>` estile ak modifikatè afichaj, rekòt, ak efè ki anpile."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Effects compose through the shared `--pantoken-img-filter` custom property, so `-with-grayscale` and `-with-blur` can apply together; the `-constrain-*` crop modifiers require the consumer to size the box explicitly."
msgstr "Efè yo konpoze atravè pwopriyete koutim pataje `--pantoken-img-filter`, kidonk `-with-grayscale` ak `-with-blur` ka aplike ansanm; modifikatè rekòt `-constrain-*` mande pou konsomatè a detèmine gwosè bwat la eksplisitman."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [img.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/img/img.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [img.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/img/img.css)"

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Provide meaningful `alt` text that describes the image, and use an empty `alt=\"\"` for purely decorative images so assistive tech skips them."
msgstr "Bay tèks `alt` ki gen sans ki dekri imaj la, epi itilize yon `alt=\"\"` vid pou imaj ki sèlman dekoratif pou teknoloji asistans yo ka sote yo."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scale to fit within the box (contain)."
msgstr "Eskalye pou anfòm andedan bwat la (contain)."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scale to fill the box (cover)."
msgstr "Eskalye pou ranpli bwat la (cover)."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Display as a block element."
msgstr "Afiche kòm yon eleman blòk."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply a blur effect."
msgstr "Aplike yon efè flou."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply a grayscale effect."
msgstr "Aplike yon efè echèl gri."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "filter &lt;filter-value-list&gt; \\| none — The composed CSS filter on the image; the effect modifiers set it, and you can override it for a custom filter."
msgstr "filter &lt;filter-value-list&gt; \\| none — Filtre CSS konpoze sou imaj la; modifikatè efè yo mete li, epi ou ka ranplase li pou yon filtre koutim."

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: in-place-edit"
msgstr ""

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-in-place-edit` — A [contenteditable] that reads as text until focused, then shows input chrome."
msgstr "`.instui-in-place-edit` — Yon [contenteditable] ki li kòm tèks jiskaske li genyen konsantre, epi li montre chrome antre a."

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The input chrome only appears while focused; `-readonly` suppresses both the hover and focus affordances so the element always reads as plain inline text."
msgstr "Chrome antre a parèt sèlman pandan li gen konsantre; `-readonly` anpeche toude afordans hover ak focus pou eleman an toujou li kòm tèks inline senp."

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [in-place-edit.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/in-place-edit/in-place-edit.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [in-place-edit.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/in-place-edit/in-place-edit.css)"

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Give the editable element `role=\"textbox\"` and an accessible name (`aria-label`)."
msgstr "Bay eleman editab la `role=\"textbox\"` ak yon non aksesib (`aria-label`)."

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Shown inline but not editable (no hover/focus affordance)."
msgstr "Montre inline men pa editab (pa gen afordans hover/focus)."

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — On focus it shows the same input chrome as a text input."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Lè li gen konsantre li montre menm chrome antre a tankou yon text input."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS API reference"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CSS API reference covers pantoken's class-based component layer: components, utilities, global rules, and declarations built on the token system."
msgstr "Referans API CSS la kouvri kouch konpozan pantoken ki baze sou klas: konpozan, sèvis itil (utilities), règ global, ak deklarasyon yo bati sou sistèm token an."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Components"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Non"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "Class"
msgstr "Klas"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Rezime"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A surface container for AI agents."
msgstr "Yon kontenè sifas pou ajan AI."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An inline message with a status colour bar and a masked status glyph from the shared icon set."
msgstr "Yon mesaj anliy ak yon ba koulè estati ak yon glif estati kache ki soti nan ansanm ikon pataje a."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A user avatar showing initials or an image, circular by default."
msgstr "Yon avatar itilizatè ki montre inisyal oswa yon imaj, sikilè pa defo."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A small count or status dot placed over a target's corner."
msgstr "Yon ti koulè oswa pwen estati pou konte ki plase sou kwen sib la."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A dismissible, iconed message surface for page-level or in-context announcements."
msgstr "Yon sifas mesaj ki ka fèmen, ak ikon, pou anons nivo paj oswa an-konteks."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A large empty-state or call-to-action block: a hero icon or image, a heading, and a message."
msgstr "Yon gwo blòk eta vid oswa apèl-a-aksyon: yon ikon oswa imaj ewo, yon tit, ak yon mesaj."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A breadcrumb trail with separators; the last crumb is the current page."
msgstr "Yon tras breadcrumb ak separatè; dènye moso a se paj aktyèl la."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A crumb (InstUI `Breadcrumb.Link`), an `<li>` in the parent's `<ol>`; the last one is the current page."
msgstr "Yon moso (InstUI `Breadcrumb.Link`), yon `<li>` nan `<ol>` paran an; dènye a se paj aktyèl la."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An accessible action control, styled from the token palette; primary by default."
msgstr "Yon kontwòl aksyon aksesib, estilize soti nan palèt token la; prensipal pa defo."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A media object: a hero figure beside a title and description."
msgstr "Yon objè medya: yon figi ewo sou kote yon tit ak deskripsyon."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A static month grid with navigation, weekday headers, and day cells."
msgstr "Yon griy mwa estatik ak navigasyon, tèt jou semèn, ak selil jou."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A day cell (InstUI `Calendar.Day`); `-today`, `-selected`, and `-outside-month` mark its state."
msgstr "Yon selil jou (InstUI `Calendar.Day`); `-today`, `-selected`, ak `-outside-month` make eta li."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A surface container that accepts arbitrary content."
msgstr "Yon kontenè sifas ki aksepte kontni anvaryab."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A native checkbox and its label, or a switch via `-variant-toggle`."
msgstr "Yon ti bwat chèk natif natal ak etikèt li, oswa yon switch atravè `-variant-toggle`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A transparent icon button that draws its own × glyph, in three sizes plus an on-color variant."
msgstr "Yon bouton ikon transparan ki trase pwòp glif × li, nan twa gwosè plis yon varyant sou-koulè."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An elevated callout with a caret, positionable on any side; works as a native `[popover]`."
msgstr "Yon callout leve ak yon caret, pozisyonab sou nenpòt bò; fonksyone kòm yon `[popover]` natif natal."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A split layout with a collapsible side tray and a primary scrollable content pane."
msgstr "Yon layout separe ak yon tiwa bò ki ka fèmen epi yon panèl kontni prensipal ki ka scroll."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The primary content pane that fills remaining space beside the tray."
msgstr "Panèl kontni prensipal la ki ranpli espas ki rete bò tiwa a."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The side panel beside main content, with optional overlay and tray-like surface modifiers."
msgstr "Panno bò a bò kote kontni prensipal la, ak opsyon pou overlay ak modifikatè sifas tankou tiwa."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A file dropzone with hover, accepted, and rejected states."
msgstr "Yon zòn depo dosye ak eta hover, aksepte, ak rejte."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A form-field wrapper: a label, its controls, and inline, required, or readonly layouts."
msgstr "Yon vlope chan fòm: yon etikèt, kontwòl li yo, ak layout anliy, obligatwa, oswa readonly."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `<fieldset>` group with a legend, a column or inline layout, and configurable spacing."
msgstr "Yon gwoup `<fieldset>` ak yon lejann, yon layout kolòn oswa anliy, ak espas konfigirab."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Field help and validation messages — hint, error, success, and screen-reader-only — with a glyph on error and success."
msgstr "Èd chan ak mesaj validasyon — konsèy, erè, siksè, ak sèlman pou lektè ekran — ak yon glif sou erè ak siksè."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Heading typography from `-level-h1` to `-level-h6`."
msgstr "Tipografi tit soti nan `-level-h1` rive `-level-h6`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled `<img>` with display, crop, and effect modifiers that stack."
msgstr "Yon `<img>` estilize ak modifikatè ekspozisyon, koupe, ak efè ki pile."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [contenteditable] that reads as text until focused, then shows input chrome."
msgstr "Yon [contenteditable] ki li kòm tèks jiskaske li pran fokus, epi li montre chrome antre."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A facade around a text input with leading and trailing icon slots."
msgstr "Yon fasad alantou yon antre tèks ak plas ikon devan ak dèyè."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled hyperlink with sizes, an inverse variant for dark backgrounds, and inline or unstyled forms."
msgstr "Yon lyen estilize ak gwosè, yon varyant envès pou background fè nwa, ak fòm anliy oswa san stil."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A list with token-driven item spacing."
msgstr "Yon lis ak espas atik kondwi pa token."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A list item (InstUI `List.Item`)."
msgstr "Yon atik lis (InstUI `List.Item`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An in-flow overlay that fills its positioned parent and centres its content — e.g. a spinner over a card. For a modal, prefer a native `<dialog>` (its `::backdrop` is the mask). Every one of these modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other component) — see the `mask` global utility."
msgstr "Yon overlay nan koule ki ranpli paran pozisyone li epi santre kontni li — egzanp: yon spinner sou yon kat. Pou yon modal, prefere yon `<dialog>` natif natal (mask li se `::backdrop`). Chak youn nan modifikatè sa yo disponib tou globalman (tèt, oswa chèn sou nenpòt lòt konpozan) — wè utilite global `mask`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A dropdown surface of items, groups, and separators."
msgstr "Yon sifas dropdown ki gen atik, gwoup, ak separatè."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A labelled group heading (InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`)."
msgstr "Yon tit gwoup ki gen etikèt (InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A menu entry (InstUI `Menu.Item`); add -disabled, -highlighted, or -active/[aria-checked]."
msgstr "Yon antre meni (InstUI `Menu.Item`); ajoute -disabled, -highlighted, oswa -active/[aria-checked]."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A divider rule between items (InstUI `Menu.Separator`)."
msgstr "Yon règ divizè ant atik (InstUI `Menu.Separator`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A labelled statistic — a large value over a caption."
msgstr "Yon estatistik ki gen etikèt — yon valè gwo sou yon caption."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A dialog surface (works on a native &lt;dialog&gt;); header/body/footer parts."
msgstr "Yon sifas dyalòg (fonksyone sou yon &lt;dialog&gt; natif natal); pati header/body/footer."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The content region (InstUI `Modal.Body`); a lone `<img>` goes full-bleed."
msgstr "Rejyon kontni an (InstUI `Modal.Body`); yon sèl `<img>` ale full-bleed."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The actions row (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."
msgstr "Ranje aksyon yo (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The title row (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."
msgstr "Ranje tit la (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A number-input facade with a +/- spinner column."
msgstr "Yon fasad antre nimewo ak yon kolòn spinner +/-."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Page navigation: numbered pages, first, previous, next, and last arrows, and an ellipsis for gaps."
msgstr "Navigasyon paj: paj nimewote, premye, anvan, pwochen, ak dènye flèch, ak yon elips pou espas vid."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A page link or button (InstUI `Pagination.Page`); the current page carries `[aria-current]`."
msgstr "Yon lyen paj oswa bouton (InstUI `Pagination.Page`); paj aktyèl la pote `[aria-current]`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A compact status label; add a leading glyph with the shared `-icon-<name>` form."
msgstr "Yon etikèt estati kontra; ajoute yon glif devan ak fòm pataje `-icon-<name>`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An elevated surface for a native `[popover]`, positioned with CSS anchor positioning."
msgstr "Yon sifas leve pou yon `[popover]` natif natal, pozisyone ak pozisyon anchè CSS."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A determinate progress bar with a coloured meter, sizes, and an optional value label."
msgstr "Yon ba pwogrè detèmine ak yon mezi koulè, gwosè, ak yon etikèt valè opsyonèl."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A circular progress ring driven by `--value` and `--value-max` custom properties."
msgstr "Yon bag pwogrè sikilè ki kondwi pa pwopriyete koutim `--value` ak `--value-max`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A native radio button and its label."
msgstr "Yon bouton radyo natif natal ak etikèt li."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A single-select radio `<fieldset>`, plain or as a connected segmented toggle."
msgstr "Yon `<fieldset>` radio sèl-chwazi, senp oswa kòm yon toggle segmante konekte."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled range slider with an inverse value bubble."
msgstr "Yon slider ranje estilize ak yon boul valè inverse."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A star rating with filled and empty glyphs and an optional numeric label."
msgstr "Yon evalyasyon etwal ak glif plen ak vid e yon etikèt nimewik opsyonèl."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A vertical navigation rail of icon-over-label items, with a minimized icons-only mode."
msgstr "Yon rail navigasyon vètikal ki gen atik ikon sou etikèt, ak yon mòd minimize ki montre sèlman ikon yo."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A navigation entry (InstUI `SideNavBar.Item`); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "Yon antre navigasyon (InstUI `SideNavBar.Item`); `-selected` make youn ki aktif la."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled native `<select>` with a caret, matching the text-input states and sizes."
msgstr "Yon `<select>` natif estilize ak yon karekèt, ki matche ak eta ak gwosè antre tèks yo."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An animated loading ring; give it role=\"status\" and an aria-label."
msgstr "Yon bag chajman anime; bay li role=\"status\" ak yon aria-label."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled data table for `th` and `td` plus an optional caption, with hover, fixed, and stacked-card layouts."
msgstr "Yon tablo done estilize pou `th` ak `td` plis yon caption opsyonèl, ak modèl hover, fiks, ak kat-stake."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The table's data row group (InstUI `Table.Body`)."
msgstr "Gwoup ranje done tablo a (InstUI `Table.Body`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A data cell (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."
msgstr "Yon selil done (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A column-header cell (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); the default `th` styling, overridden by `table.row-header` for `th[scope=\"row\"]`."
msgstr "Yon selil tèt kolòn (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); style defo `th` la, ranplase pa `table.row-header` pou `th[scope=\"row\"]`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The table's header row group (InstUI `Table.Head`)."
msgstr "Gwoup ranje tèt tablo a (InstUI `Table.Head`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A table row (InstUI `Table.Row`)."
msgstr "Yon ranje tablo (InstUI `Table.Row`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A row-header cell (InstUI `Table.RowHeader`); styled from the row-header tokens, not the column-header ones."
msgstr "Yon selil tèt ranje (InstUI `Table.RowHeader`); estilize soti nan tokens tèt ranje yo, pa sa ki pou tèt kolòn yo."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A tabbed panel set: a tab list, selectable tabs, and their panels."
msgstr "Yon seri panèl ak tab: yon lis tab, tab seleksyone, ak panèl yo."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The content panel for a tab (InstUI `Tabs.Panel`)."
msgstr "Panèl kontni pou yon tab (InstUI `Tabs.Panel`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A single tab button (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, configured via the parent `Tabs`'s tab list); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "Yon sèl bouton tab (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, configured via parent `Tabs`'s tab list); `-selected` make youn ki aktif la."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An inline chip for a keyword or filter."
msgstr "Yon chip an liy pou yon mo kle oswa filtè."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Body-text typography with size, weight, colour, and style modifiers."
msgstr "Tipografi tèks kò ak modifye gwosè, pwa, koulè, ak estil."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled, resizable native `<textarea>` with the same states and sizes as the text input."
msgstr "Yon `<textarea>` natif estilize, rezizable, ak menm eta ak gwosè kòm antre tèks la."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled native `<input>` — including `date`, `time`, and `datetime-local`, where the browser supplies the picker — with validation states and sizes."
msgstr "Yon `<input>` natif estilize — enkli `date`, `time`, ak `datetime-local`, kote navigatè a bay picker la — ak eta validasyon ak gwosè."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled native `<details>` disclosure with a rotating chevron."
msgstr "Yon `<details>` natif estilize disclosure ak yon chevron ki vire."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A bordered disclosure built on `<details>`: a chevron summary row and collapsible content."
msgstr "Yon disclosure ak bor bati sou `<details>`: yon ranje rezime chevron ak kontni kolapsab."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A CSS hover and focus tooltip bubble, positionable on any side."
msgstr "Yon bul tooltip CSS pou hover ak focus, pozisyone sou nenpòt bò."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An edge-pinned panel that slides in from any side; a native `[popover]` or `<dialog>`."
msgstr "Yon panèl pinen sou kwen ki glise depi nenpòt bò; yon `[popover]` natif oswa `<dialog>`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A disclosure tree of nested collections and leaf items, with rotating chevrons."
msgstr "Yon pyebwa disclosure ak koleksyon nidifye ak atik fèy, ak chevron ki vire."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The View primitive: a neutral box with key-value modifiers for background, border, radius, shadow, display, position, overflow, and cursor. Every one of these modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other component) — see the `background`/`border`/`shadow`/`display`/`position`/`overflow`/`cursor` utilities."
msgstr "Primiti View la: yon bwat netral ak modifye kle-valè pou background, bor, radius, lonbraj, ekspozisyon, pozisyon, debòde, ak kousè. Chak youn nan modifye sa yo disponib tou globalman (bare, oswa chèn sou nenpòt lòt konponent) — wè utiliti `background`/`border`/`shadow`/`display`/`position`/`overflow`/`cursor`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Utilities"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Semantic colour utilities: `.--bg-<name>`, `.--text-<name>` (aliased as `.--color-<name>`), and `.--border-<name>` for the curated semantic palette. Every one of these also has a component-attached alias modifier (for example `-bg-danger` on any `.instui-<component>`)."
msgstr "Utiliti koulè semantik: `.--bg-<name>`, `.--text-<name>` (aliase kòm `.--color-<name>`), ak `.--border-<name>` pou palèt semantik kouvri a. Chak youn nan sa yo gen tou yon alias modifye atache a konpozan (pa egzanp `-bg-danger` sou nenpòt `.instui-<component>`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`cursor` as a composable, global class — `.--cursor-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--cursor-pointer`)."
msgstr "`cursor` kòm yon klas global konpoze — `.--cursor-<value>` — ki ka itilize bare oswa chèn sou nenpòt konpozan (`.instui-button.--cursor-pointer`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Flex/grid `gap` utilities on the spacing scale, short (`--gap-sm`) or long (`--gap-small`) spelling. Usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — components that already set their own `gap` from a component-specific token may have it overridden."
msgstr "Utiliti flex/grid `gap` sou echèl espas la, òt (`--gap-sm`) oswa long (`--gap-small`) òtograf. Kapab itilize bare oswa chèn sou nenpòt konpozan (`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — konpozan ki deja mete pwòp `gap` yo pa yon token espesifik ka gen li ranplase."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The icon system: `.instui-icon` sizing plus the shared `-icon-<name>` painter that masks a glyph (in `currentColor`) before any element."
msgstr "Sistèm ikon an: gwosè `.instui-icon` plis pent ki pataje `-icon-<name>` ki kouvri yon glif (nan `currentColor`) anvan nenpòt eleman."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Display and text-align utilities — `.--display-<value>` and `.--text-align-<value>` — as composable, global classes, usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "Utiliti ekspozisyon ak aliman tèks — `.--display-<value>` ak `.--text-align-<value>` — kòm klas global konpoze, ki ka itilize bare oswa chèn sou nenpòt konpozan."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A global, dual copy of the `mask` component's overlay modifiers — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — usable bare or chained onto any component, without wrapping in a `.instui-mask` element."
msgstr "Yon kopi dual global nan modifye overlay konpozan `mask` la — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — kap itilize bare oswa chèn sou nenpòt konpozan, san anvlòp nan yon eleman `.instui-mask`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`overflow-x`/`overflow-y` as composable, global classes — `.--overflow-x-<value>` / `.--overflow-y-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "`overflow-x`/`overflow-y` kòm klas global konpoze — `.--overflow-x-<value>` / `.--overflow-y-<value>` — kap itilize bare oswa chèn sou nenpòt konpozan."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`position` as a composable, global class — `.--position-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--position-relative`)."
msgstr "`position` kòm yon klas global konpoze — `.--position-<value>` — kap itilize bare oswa chèn sou nenpòt konpozan (`.instui-button.--position-relative`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Viewport- or container-width show/hide classes across a themed breakpoint scale."
msgstr "Klas montre/kache sou lajè Viewport oswa konteynè atravè yon echèl breakpoint tèm."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Visually hides content while keeping it available to assistive tech (the standard clip pattern)."
msgstr "Kache vizyèlman kontni pandan w kenbe li disponib pou teknoloji asistans (modèl clip estanda)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Margin and padding utilities — `.--m<side>-<step>` / `.--margin-<side>-<step>` and `.--p<side>-<step>` / `.--padding-<side>-<step>` on the spacing scale (sides `t`/`b`/`s`/`e`/`x`/`y` or none, spelled short or fully long — for example `--mb-sm` and `--margin-bottom-small` are the same rule; margin also takes `auto`). Usable bare or chained onto any component (for example `class=\"instui-view --mb-sm\"`)."
msgstr "Itilite margin ak padding — `.--m<side>-<step>` / `.--margin-<side>-<step>` ak `.--p<side>-<step>` / `.--padding-<side>-<step>` sou echèl espas (bò `t`/`b`/`s`/`e`/`x`/`y` oswa pa gen youn, ekri kout oswa long — pa egzanp `--mb-sm` ak `--margin-bottom-small` se menm règ la; margin pran tou `auto`). Ka itilize poukont oswa chenn sou nenpòt konpozan (pa egzanp `class=\"instui-view --mb-sm\"`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "z-index depth utilities — `.--stack-<level>` (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) — usable bare or chained onto any component, so layers stack predictably instead of by hand-tuned numbers."
msgstr "Itilite pwofondè z-index — `.--stack-<level>` (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) — ka itilize poukont oswa chenn sou nenpòt konpozan, konsa kouch yo empile previzib olye de lè w ap sèvi ak nimewo reglaj manyèl."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animation state classes for the `Transition` component — `.instui-transition` and state classes (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, etc.) — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "Klas eta animasyon pou konpozan `Transition` — `.instui-transition` ak klas eta (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, elatriye) — ka itilize poukont oswa chenn sou nenpòt konpozan."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Ellipsis truncation with line clamping controlled by `--lines` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."
msgstr "Troncature ak elips ak konpresyon liy kontwole pa `--lines` — ka itilize poukont oswa chenn sou nenpòt konpozan (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A layout-debugging outline: compound `.-with-visual-debug` onto any element to outline the box and its immediate children, so a layout's structure is visible at a glance."
msgstr "Yon kontou pou débogaj layout: konpoze `.-with-visual-debug` sou nenpòt eleman pou trase bwat la ak timoun imedya li yo, konsa estrikti layout la vizib an yon kout je."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Rules"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The opt-in global reset: `box-sizing`, the page surface, base text colour and font, `color-scheme`, and link defaults."
msgstr "Reset global opt-in: `box-sizing`, sifas paj la, koulè tèks baz ak polis, `color-scheme`, ak defo lyen yo."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Typographic defaults for raw HTML — headings, paragraphs, lists, links, and code — applied automatically wherever it's imported (default `:where(body)`); pass `options.scope` to target a different content root instead (e.g. `.vp-doc`)."
msgstr "Default tipografik pou HTML brit — tit, paragraf, lis, lyen, ak kòd — aplike otomatikman kote li enpòte (default `:where(body)`); pase `options.scope` pou vize yon rasin kontni diferan (egzanp `.vp-doc`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Plugins"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Instructure product logos as CSS image tokens: `--instui-logo-<product>-<layout>-<mode>` holds a data-URI SVG, so a logo paints via e.g. `background-image: var(--instui-logo-canvas-horizontal-color)`."
msgstr "Logo pwodwi Instructure kòm token imaj CSS: `--instui-logo-<product>-<layout>-<mode>` kenbe yon SVG data-URI, konsa yon logo ka pentire pa egzanp `background-image: var(--instui-logo-canvas-horizontal-color)`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Opt-in utility classes for the raw primitive palette: `.instui-bg-`/`fg-`/`border-primitive-color-<name>` paint a colour from the primitive colour tokens, plus `font-family`/`font-weight` utilities for the primitive font tokens. Kept out of the semantic utilities so overrides there stay semantic-only."
msgstr "Klas sèvis opt-in pou palèt primitif brit la: `.instui-bg-`/`fg-`/`border-primitive-color-<name>` pentire yon koulè soti nan token koulè primitif yo, plis itilite `font-family`/`font-weight` pou token polis primitif yo. Kenbe yo izole nan itilite semantik yo pou override yo rete sèlman semantik."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## layout"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline information alert for a short reminder or note."
msgstr "Alèt enfòmasyon anliy pou yon rapèl kout oswa nòt."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Full-width header section with title, subtitle, and optional background image."
msgstr "Seksyon header lajè tout ekran ak tit, sou-tit, ak imaj background opsyonèl."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Standard three-column page layout with header, sidebar, and main content."
msgstr "Layout paj estanda twa kolòn ak header, sidebar, ak kontni prensipal."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Structured note with rubric categories and scoring indicators."
msgstr "Nòt estriktire ak kategori rubrik ak endikatè nòtaj."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Quote or testimonial display with attribution and optional imagery."
msgstr "Afichaj sitasyon oswa temwayaj ak atribisyon ak imaj opsyonèl."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Two-column layout with left and right content regions."
msgstr "Layout de kolòn ak rejyon kontni gòch ak dwat."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "App-shell row: side nav, container with header, and optional panel."
msgstr "Ranje app-shell: nav bò, kontenè ak header, ak yon panèl opsyonèl."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: input-group"
msgstr ""

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-input-group` — A facade around a text input with leading and trailing icon slots."
msgstr "`.instui-input-group` — Yon fasad alantou yon antre tèks ak espas icône devan ak dèyè."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wraps the same field chrome as `text-input` with icon slots either side of it; `-should-not-wrap` is only needed when the group's contents would otherwise overflow onto a second line."
msgstr "Anvlòp menm chrome chan an tankou `text-input` ak espas icône sou toude bò; `-should-not-wrap` sèlman nesesè lè kontni gwoup la ta debòde sou yon dezyèm liy."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [input-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/input-group/input-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [input-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/input-group/input-group.css)"

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Disabled state."
msgstr "Eta enfim."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Keep the group on one line (no wrapping)."
msgstr "Kenbe gwoup la sou yon sèl liy (pa gen anvlopman)."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Success (valid) state."
msgstr "Eta siksè (valab)."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The trailing content slot."
msgstr "Espas pou kontni dèyè a."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The leading content slot."
msgstr "Espas pou kontni devan an."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The placeholder text of the inner input, in a muted color."
msgstr "Tèks placeholder nan antre anndan an, nan yon koulè fèb."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Wraps a text input, adding leading and trailing icon slots."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Anvlope yon antre tèks, ajoute espas icône devan ak dèyè."

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: layout"
msgstr ""

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--display-flex` — Display and text-align utilities — `.--display-<value>` and `.--text-align-<value>` — as composable, global classes, usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "`.--display-flex` — Itilite afichaj ak aligman tèks — `.--display-<value>` ak `.--text-align-<value>` — kòm klas global konpozab, kapab itilize poukont oswa an chèn sou nenpòt konpozan."

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/layout/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/layout/index.ts)"

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets `display: flex`."
msgstr "Mete `display: flex`."

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Display utilities: `block`, `inline-block`, `inline`, `flex`, `inline-flex`, and `none`."
msgstr "Itilite afichaj: `block`, `inline-block`, `inline`, `flex`, `inline-flex`, ak `none`."

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Text-alignment utilities: `start`, `center`, `end`, and `justify`."
msgstr "Itilite pou aligman tèks: `start`, `center`, `end`, ak `justify`."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: link"
msgstr ""

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-link` — A styled hyperlink with sizes, an inverse variant for dark backgrounds, and inline or unstyled forms."
msgstr "`.instui-link` — Yon lyen ak stil ki gen gwosè, yon varyant envès pou background fè nwa, ak fòm anliy oswa san stil."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own responsive `gap` between an icon and its text (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` scale it); chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Detèmine pwòp `gap` reponn li ant yon ikon ak tèks li (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` ajiste l); chenn yon modifikatè itilite espas `-gap-*` ranplase valè entegre sa a."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [link.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/link/link.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [link.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/link/link.css)"

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark a disabled link with `aria-disabled=\"true\"`."
msgstr "Fè yon lyen enfim ak `aria-disabled=\"true\"`."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For dark backgrounds."
msgstr "Pou background fè nwa."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline link, underlined within flowing text."
msgstr "Lyen anliy, souliye nan tèks k ap koule."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large inline link (used with `-inline`)."
msgstr "Gwo lyen anliy (itilize ak `-inline`)."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small inline link (used with `-inline`)."
msgstr "Ti lyen anliy (itilize ak `-inline`)."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Strip link styling: inherit colour, no underline."
msgstr "Retire stil lyen: erite koulè, pa gen liy anba."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [breadcrumb](/api/css/breadcrumb.md) — A breadcrumb trail is built from links; also its small-screen fallback (pair with the `responsive` utility to swap Breadcrumb for a Link below ~768px)."
msgstr "- [breadcrumb](/api/css/breadcrumb.md) — Yon tras breadcrumb bati ak lyen; osi byen solisyon li pou ti ekran (mete ansanm ak itilite `responsive` pou chanje Breadcrumb pou yon Link anba ~768px)."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: list.item"
msgstr ""

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-list` — A list item (InstUI `List.Item`)."
msgstr "`.instui-list` — Yon atik lis (InstUI `List.Item`)."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `list`'s `-size-sm`/`-size-lg`, `-ordered`, and `-delimiter-solid`/`-delimiter-dashed` modifiers restyle this member — see `list`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Modifikatè `-size-sm`/`-size-lg`, `-ordered`, ak `-delimiter-solid`/`-delimiter-dashed` nan paran `list` chanje aparans manm sa a — wè dokiman `list` pou modifikatè sa yo."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Separate items with a dashed rule. @affects list.item — Adds the delimiter rule between items."
msgstr "Separe atik yo ak yon liy tire. @affects list.item — Ajoute règ delimite ant atik yo."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Separate items with a solid rule. @affects list.item — Adds the delimiter rule between items."
msgstr "Separe atik yo ak yon liy solid. @affects list.item — Ajoute règ delimite ant atik yo."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Ordered-list numbering. @affects list.item — Adds marker weight and indentation."
msgstr "Nimewotasyon lis òdone. @affects list.item — Ajoute pwa makè ak endantasyon."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the list bullet or ordered-list number."
msgstr "Afiche boul lis la oswa nimewo lis òdone a."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: list"
msgstr ""

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-list` — A list with token-driven item spacing."
msgstr "`.instui-list` — Yon lis ak espas atik ki kontwole pa token."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `padding-inline-start` for list indentation; chaining a `-p*`/`-padding*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value. See the `list.item` member for the individual items."
msgstr "Detèmine pwòp `padding-inline-start` li pou endantasyon lis la; lè yo chèn yon modifikatè espas `-p*`/`-padding*`, li ranplase valè entegre sa a. Gade manm `list.item` pou atik endividyèl yo."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [list.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/list/list.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [list.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/list/list.css)"

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay items out inline (horizontal)."
msgstr "Mete atik yo an liy (orizontal)."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large. @affects list.item — Scales the item spacing to match. Long-form alias of `-size-lg`."
msgstr "Gwo. @affects list.item — Ajiste espas ant atik yo pou matche. Alyas long pou `-size-lg`."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large. @affects list.item — Scales the item spacing to match."
msgstr "Gwo. @affects list.item — Ajiste espas ant atik yo pou matche."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium (default). @affects list.item — Scales the item spacing to match."
msgstr "Mwayen (pa defo). @affects list.item — Ajiste espas ant atik yo pou matche."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium (default). @affects list.item — Scales the item spacing to match. Long-form alias of `-size-md`."
msgstr "Mwayen (pa defo). @affects list.item — Ajiste espas ant atik yo pou matche. Alyas long pou `-size-md`."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small. @affects list.item — Scales the item spacing to match."
msgstr "Ti. @affects list.item — Ajiste espas ant atik yo pou matche."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small. @affects list.item — Scales the item spacing to match. Long-form alias of `-size-sm`."
msgstr "Ti. @affects list.item — Ajiste espas ant atik yo pou matche. Alyas long pou `-size-sm`."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove markers and padding."
msgstr "Retire makè yo ak padding la."

