#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-page-layout\"]` — Standard three-column page layout with header, sidebar, and main content."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-page-layout\"]` — Layout paj estanda twa kolòn ak tèt, ba kote, ak kontni prensipal."

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Page-Layout when:"
msgstr "✅ Itilize Page-Layout lè:"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- You need a classic page structure with navigation and content areas\n- The page has a clear main content area flanked by complementary regions\n- You want consistent spacing and alignment across the layout\n🚫 Don't use Page-Layout when:"
msgstr "- Ou bezwen yon estrikti paj klasik ak navigasyon ak zòn kontni\n- Paj la gen yon zòn kontni prensipal ki klè ak zòn konplemantè sou kote\n- Ou vle espasman ak aliman ki konsistan atravè layout la\n🚫 Pa itilize Page-Layout lè:"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a single-column page — use a simpler layout instead\n- The sidebar competes with main content for importance"
msgstr "- W ap konstwi yon paj yon sèl kolòn — itilize yon layout pi senp pito\n- Ba kote a konpetisyon ak kontni prensipal la pou enpòtans"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Map the main content area to a `<main>` landmark\n- Give the sidebar `role=\"navigation\"` or `role=\"complementary\"` as appropriate\n- Ensure landmark regions have distinct aria-labels"
msgstr "- Map zòn kontni prensipal la nan yon pwen referans `<main>`\n- Bay ba kote a `role=\"navigation\"` oswa `role=\"complementary\"` jan sa apwopriye\n- Asire zòn referans yo gen aria-label ki diferan"

#: css/page-layout.md
