msgstr "Ekstra-ti."

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: stacking"
msgstr ""

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--stack-topmost` — z-index depth utilities — `.--stack-<level>` (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) — usable bare or chained onto any component, so layers stack predictably instead of by hand-tuned numbers."
msgstr "`.--stack-topmost` — sèvis utilitè pwofondè z-index — `.--stack-<level>` (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) — ka itilize endepandan oswa chèn sou nenpòt konpozan, konsa kouch yo ranje previzibman olye de nimewo ajiste manyèlman."

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/stacking/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/stacking/index.ts)"

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Above the default flow."
msgstr "Anwo koule default la."

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Below the default flow."
msgstr "Anba koule default la."

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The lowest stacking depth."
msgstr "Pwofondè pil ki pi ba a."

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The highest stacking depth (overlays, menus)."
msgstr "Pwofondè pil ki pi wo a (kouch sipèpoze, meni)."

#: css/table.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.body"
msgstr "# CSS: table.body"

#: css/table.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`tbody` — The table's data row group (InstUI `Table.Body`)."
msgstr "`tbody` — Gwoup ranje done tab la (InstUI `Table.Body`)."

#: css/table.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier restyles this member — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Modifikatè `-layout-stacked` nan paran `table` la chanje stil manm sa a — gade dokiman `table` pou modifikatè sa a."

#: css/table.cell.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.cell"
msgstr "# CSS: table.cell"

#: css/table.cell.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`td` — A data cell (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."
msgstr "`td` — Yon selil done (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."

#: css/table.cell.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier stacks this member as a block and labels it via `::before` — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Modifikatè `-layout-stacked` nan paran `table` ranje manm sa a kòm yon blòk epi etikete li atravè `::before` — gade dokiman `table` pou modifikatè sa a."

#: css/table.col-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.col-header"
msgstr "# CSS: table.col-header"

#: css/table.col-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`th` — A column-header cell (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); the default `th` styling, overridden by `table.row-header` for `th[scope=\"row\"]`."
msgstr "`th` — Yon selil tèt kolòn (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); estil `th` default la, ranplase pa `table.row-header` pou `th[scope=\"row\"]`."

#: css/table.head.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.head"
msgstr "# CSS: table.head"

#: css/table.head.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`thead` — The table's header row group (InstUI `Table.Head`)."
msgstr "`thead` — Gwoup ranje tèt tablo a (InstUI `Table.Head`)."

#: css/table.head.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier visually hides this member (its column titles surface per-cell instead) — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Modifier `-layout-stacked` nan paran `table` la kache vizyèlman manm sa a (tit kolòn li yo parèt pou chak selil olye) — gade dokiman `table` pou modifier sa a."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table"
msgstr ""

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-table` — A styled data table for `th` and `td` plus an optional caption, with hover, fixed, and stacked-card layouts."
msgstr "`.instui-table` — Yon tab done estilize pou `th` ak `td`, plis yon caption opsyonèl, ak efè hover, layout fiks, ak aranjman kat anpile."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For `-layout-stacked`, pure CSS can't pull each column header's text into its cell, so give every cell a `data-label` and the stacked card shows it via `::before`. See the `table.head`, `table.body`, `table.row`, `table.cell`, `table.col-header`, and `table.row-header` members for the individual parts."
msgstr "Pou `-layout-stacked`, CSS pwòp pa ka rale tèks chak kolòn header nan selil li, kidonk bay chak selil yon `data-label` epi kat anpile a montre li atravè `::before`. Gade manm `table.head`, `table.body`, `table.row`, `table.cell`, `table.col-header`, ak `table.row-header` pou pati endividyèl yo."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/table/members/body/body.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/table/members/body/body.css)"

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Label the table with a `<caption>`, mark column headers `<th scope=\"col\">` and row headers `<th scope=\"row\">`, and in `-layout-stacked` give every cell a `data-label` since the header row is visually hidden."
msgstr "Mete yon `<caption>` kòm etikèt tab la, make header kolòn yo kòm `<th scope=\"col\">` ak header ranje yo kòm `<th scope=\"row\">`, epi nan `-layout-stacked` bay chak selil yon `data-label` paske ranje header la kache vizyèlman."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Highlight rows on hover. @affects table.row — Reserves and colours the row's hover border."
msgstr "Mete aksan sou ranje lè w pase sourit la. @affects table.row — Rezève epi kolore bor hover ranje a."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Fixed table layout (equal-width columns)."
msgstr "Layout tab fiks (kolòn egal lajè)."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stack each row as a card, via a per-cell `data-label`. @affects table.head @affects table.body @affects table.row @affects table.cell @affects table.col-header @affects table.row-header — Stacks each part as a block and hides/labels the header accordingly."
msgstr "Anpile chak ranje kòm yon kat, atravè yon `data-label` pou chak selil. @affects table.head @affects table.body @affects table.row @affects table.cell @affects table.col-header @affects table.row-header — Anpile chak pati kòm yon blòk epi kache/etikèt header la kòmsadwa."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An optional table caption."
msgstr "Yon caption tab opsyonèl."

#: css/table.row-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.row-header"
msgstr "# CSS: table.row-header"

#: css/table.row-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`th[scope=\"row\"]` — A row-header cell (InstUI `Table.RowHeader`); styled from the row-header tokens, not the column-header ones."
msgstr "`th[scope=\"row\"]` — Yon selil tèt ranje (InstUI `Table.RowHeader`); ki gen estil selon token tèt ranje yo, pa token tèt kolòn yo."

#: css/table.row.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.row"
msgstr "# CSS: table.row"

#: css/table.row.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`tr` — A table row (InstUI `Table.Row`)."
msgstr "`tr` — Yon ranje tab (InstUI `Table.Row`)."

#: css/table.row.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-hover` and `-layout-stacked` modifiers restyle this member — see `table`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Modifikatè `-hover` ak `-layout-stacked` nan paran `table` la reyajiste stil manm sa a — gade dokiman `table` la pou modifikatè sa yo."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tabs"
msgstr ""

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tabs` — A tabbed panel set: a tab list, selectable tabs, and their panels."
msgstr "`.instui-tabs` — Yon seri panèl ak onglet: yon lis onglet, onglet ki ka chwazi, ak panèl yo."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "See the `tabs.tab` and `tabs.panel` members for the individual tab buttons and their content panels."
msgstr "Gade manm `tabs.tab` ak `tabs.panel` pou bouton onglet endividyèl yo ak panèl kontni yo."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [panel.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tabs/members/panel/panel.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [panel.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tabs/members/panel/panel.css)"

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire the tab list with role=\"tablist\", each tab with role=\"tab\" and aria-selected, and each panel with role=\"tabpanel\"."
msgstr "Konekte lis onglet la ak role=\"tablist\", chak onglet ak role=\"tab\" ak aria-selected, epi chak panèl ak role=\"tabpanel\"."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Keep the tab list on one line and let it scroll horizontally instead of wrapping, hiding the scrollbar."
msgstr "Kenbe lis onglet la sou yon sèl liy; kite li defile orizontalman olye pou li retounen sou liy, epi kache ba defile a."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Rounded \"folder\" tabs with a selected tab that visually connects into the panel below. @affects tabs.tab — Restyles the tab buttons into the rounded \"folder\" look."
msgstr "Onglet \"katab\" awondi ak yon onglet chwazi ki konekte vizyèlman ak panèl ki anba a. @affects tabs.tab — Reestile bouton onglet yo pou yo pran aparans \"katab\" awondi a."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The row of tabs."
msgstr "Ranje onglet yo."

#: css/tabs.panel.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tabs.panel"
msgstr "# CSS: tabs.panel"

#: css/tabs.panel.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.panel` — The content panel for a tab (InstUI `Tabs.Panel`)."
msgstr "`.panel` — Panèl kontni pou yon tab (InstUI `Tabs.Panel`)."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tabs.tab"
msgstr ""

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.tab` — A single tab button (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, configured via the parent `Tabs`'s tab list); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "`.tab` — Yon sèl bouton onglet (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, konfigire atravè lis onglet paran `Tabs`); `-selected` endike sa ki aktif la."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `tabs`'s `-variant-secondary` modifier restyles this member into a rounded \"folder\" tab — see `tabs`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Modifikatè `-variant-secondary` nan paran `tabs` la chanje stil manm sa a pou fè li tounen yon onglet \"katab\" awondi — gade dokiman `tabs` la sou modifikatè sa a."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Non-interactive; same styling as `[aria-disabled=\"true\"]`/`:disabled`."
msgstr "Pa entèaktif; menm stil ak `[aria-disabled=\"true\"]`/`:disabled`."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The active tab; same styling as `[aria-selected=\"true\"]`."
msgstr "Onglet aktif la; menm stil ak `[aria-selected=\"true\"]`."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tag"
msgstr ""

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tag` — An inline chip for a keyword or filter."
msgstr "`.instui-tag` — Yon chip anliy pou yon mo kle oswa filtè."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own horizontal `padding` (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` scale it); chaining a `-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Detèmine pwòp `padding` orizontal li (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` ka echèl li); chèn yon modifikatè espas `-p-*`/`-padding-*` ranplase valè entegre sa a."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tag.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tag.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css)"

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Reads inline with text and gets a trailing dismiss glyph."
msgstr "Li anliy ak tèks epi ajoute yon glif pou fèmen ki swiv la."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Read-only (non-dismissable) tag."
msgstr "Tag sèlman lekti (ki pa ka fèmen)."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A large tag. Long-form alias of `-size-lg`."
msgstr "Yon gwo tag. Aliy long fòm pou `-size-lg`."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A large tag."
msgstr "Yon gwo tag."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A small tag."
msgstr "Yon ti tag."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A small tag. Long-form alias of `-size-sm`."
msgstr "Yon ti tag. Aliy long fòm pou `-size-sm`."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the trailing dismiss glyph on a dismissible inline tag."
msgstr "Fè parèt glif pou fèmen ki swiv la sou yon tag anliy ki ka fèmen."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [pill](/api/css/pill.md) — The read-only label-chip counterpart."
msgstr "- [pill](/api/css/pill.md) — Kontrèpati chip-etikèt sèlman lekti."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: testimonial"
msgstr ""

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-testimonial\"]` — Quote or testimonial display with attribution and optional imagery."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-testimonial\"]` — Afichaj sitasyon oswa temwayaj ak atribisyon ak imaj opsyonèl."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Testimonial when:"
msgstr "✅ Sèvi ak Testimonial lè:"

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Displaying customer or user testimonials and quotes\n- You want to highlight a statement with visual emphasis\n- Attribution and context (name, title, image) are important\n🚫 Don't use Testimonial when:"
msgstr "- Afichaj temwayaj ak sitasyon kliyan oswa itilizatè\n- Ou vle mete aksan sou yon deklarasyon avèk enfaz vizyèl\n- Atribisyon ak kontèks (non, tit, imaj) enpòtan\n🚫 Pa itilize Testimonial lè:"

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Displaying inline quotes in body text — use a blockquote element instead\n- The statement is the main focus — use Hero or Card instead"
msgstr "- Afichaj sitasyon anliy nan tèks kò a — sèvi ak yon eleman blockquote pito\n- Deklarasyon an se priyorite prensipal — sèvi ak Hero oswa Card pito"

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Use `<blockquote>` semantically for the quote\n- Ensure attribution is clear and associated with the quote\n- If using images, provide alt text"
msgstr "- Sèvi ak `<blockquote>` semantikman pou sitasyon an\n- Asire atribisyon an klè e li asosye ak sitasyon an\n- Si w ap itilize imaj, bay tèks alt"

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Attribution author name."
msgstr "Non otè pou atribisyon."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional author profile image."
msgstr "Imaj pwofil otè (opsyonèl)."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Container for quote and attribution."
msgstr "Kontenè pou sitasyon ak atribisyon."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The quoted text."
msgstr "Tèks site a."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional author title or affiliation."
msgstr "Tit oswa afilyasyon otè (opsyonèl)."

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: text-area"
msgstr ""

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-text-area` — A styled, resizable native `<textarea>` with the same states and sizes as the text input."
msgstr "`.instui-text-area` — Yon `<textarea>` natif estilize ki ka chanje gwosè, ak menm eta ak menm gwosè tankou antre tèks la."

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Shares its border, background, and focus states with `text-input` and `simple-select`; only `resize: vertical` and the taller minimum height are unique to it."
msgstr "Li pataje bor, fon, ak eta fokus li yo ak `text-input` ak `simple-select`; sèlman `resize: vertical` ak wotè minimòm ki pi wo a inik pou li."

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [text-area.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text-area/text-area.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [text-area.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text-area/text-area.css)"

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — The single-line counterpart with the same states and sizes."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Kontrepati liy sèl la ak menm eta ak menm gwosè."

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: text-input"
msgstr ""

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-text-input` — A styled native `<input>` — including `date`, `time`, and `datetime-local`, where the browser supplies the picker — with validation states and sizes."
msgstr "`.instui-text-input` — Yon `<input>` natif stilize — ki gen ladan `date`, `time`, ak `datetime-local`, kote navigatè a bay selektè a — ak eta validasyon ak gwosè."

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Shares its border, background, and state chrome with `text-area`, `simple-select`, `number-input`, and `input-group`; for `date`/`time`/`datetime-local` types the browser supplies its own picker UI, which this stylesheet doesn't style."
msgstr "Pataje fwontyè, background, ak chrome eta li avèk `text-area`, `simple-select`, `number-input`, ak `input-group`; pou tip `date`/`time`/`datetime-local` navigatè a bay pwòp entèfas selektè li, ke fichye stil sa a pa stilize."

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [text-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text-input/text-input.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [text-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text-input/text-input.css)"

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-area](/api/css/text-area.md) — The multi-line counterpart with the same states and sizes.\n- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — The numeric-entry input sharing this chrome.\n- [simple-select](/api/css/simple-select.md) — The native select sharing this field chrome.\n- [input-group](/api/css/input-group.md) — Wraps this input with leading and trailing slots."
msgstr "- [text-area](/api/css/text-area.md) — Konpayon milti-lign lan ak menm eta ak menm gwosè yo.\n- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — Antre nimewo a ki pataje menm chrome sa a.\n- [simple-select](/api/css/simple-select.md) — Select natif la ki pataje menm chrome chan sa a.\n- [input-group](/api/css/input-group.md) — Anvlòp antre sa a ak espas (slots) alavans ak dèyè."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: text"
msgstr ""

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-text` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — Body-text typography with size, weight, colour, and style modifiers."
msgstr "`.instui-text` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — Tipografi tèks kò ak modifikatè gwosè, pwa, koulè, ak stil."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `-variant-*` presets and the `-color-*`/`-size-*`/`-weight-*` modifiers all compose on the same element; unlike `heading`, it renders no implicit semantic level."
msgstr "Preset `-variant-*` yo ak modifikatè `-color-*`/`-size-*`/`-weight-*` yo tout konpoze sou menm eleman an; kontrèman ak `heading`, li pa rann okenn nivo semantik enplisit."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [text.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text/text.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [text.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text/text.css)"

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-danger pantoken-doc-tag\">Deprecated</span> — use `.-color-ai-highlight`."
msgstr ""

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "AI-accent text colour with background highlight."
msgstr "Koulè tèks aksan AI ak yon kouch background ki make."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Brand text colour."
msgstr "Koulè tèks mak la."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Danger text colour."
msgstr "Koulè tèks danje."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Primary text colour."
msgstr "Koulè tèks prensipal."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On-dark (primary inverse) text colour."
msgstr "Koulè tèks sou fon nwa (envès prensipal)."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Primary text colour on a coloured background."
msgstr "Koulè tèks prensipal sou yon background koulè."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Secondary (muted) text colour."
msgstr "Koulè tèks segondè (tamisen)."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On-dark (secondary inverse) text colour."
msgstr "Koulè tèks sou fon nwa (envès segondè)."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Secondary text colour on a coloured background."
msgstr "Koulè tèks segondè sou yon background koulè."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Success text colour."
msgstr "Koulè tèks siksè."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Warning text colour."
msgstr "Koulè tèks avètisman."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Italic."
msgstr "Italik."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Capitalise each word."
msgstr "Mete chak mo an majiskil (Capitalise each word)."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lowercase the text."
msgstr "Fè tèks la tout an miniskil."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Uppercase the text."
msgstr "Fè tèks la tout an majiskil."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Content type preset."
msgstr "Preset tip kontni."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Important-content type preset."
msgstr "Preset tip kontni enpòtan."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
