#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: wrapper"
msgstr ""

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`body[class~=\"instui-display-flex\"]` — App-shell row: side nav, container with header, and optional panel."
msgstr "`body[class~=\"instui-display-flex\"]` — Ranje app-shell: navigasyon bò, kontenè ak tèt paj, ak yon panèl opsyonèl."

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Wrapper when:"
msgstr "✅ Sèvi ak Wrapper lè:"

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a full Canvas product page that needs a consistent layout shell\n- The page uses GlobalNav as the primary navigation anchor\n- The page needs side panels: ContentTabList, TrailingContentArea, or a UtilityPanel\n- You need consistent container padding and content max-width across the full page\n🚫 Don't use Wrapper when:"
msgstr "- Ap konstwi yon paj pwodwi Canvas konplè ki bezwen yon kokiy layout ki konsistan\n- Paj la itilize GlobalNav kòm ancraj navigasyon prensipal la\n- Paj la bezwen panèl bò: ContentTabList, TrailingContentArea, oswa yon UtilityPanel\n- Ou bezwen padding kontenè ak lajè maksimòm kontni konsistan atravè tout paj la\n🚫 Pa sèvi ak Wrapper lè:"

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a Modal, Tray, or Drawer — those have their own layout containers\n- Wrapping a sub-section of a page — Wrapper contains the full page, not a region"
msgstr "- Ap konstwi yon Modal, Tray, oswa Drawer — yo gen pwòp kontenè layout yo\n- Anvlòp yon sou-seksyon nan yon paj — Wrapper kenbe tout paj la, pa yon rejyon"

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Map the main content area to a &lt;main&gt; landmark with a skip-nav link so keyboard users can bypass GlobalNav\n- Give ContentTabList role=\"navigation\" with a distinct aria-label such as \"Page navigation\" — separate from GlobalNav's landmark\n- Give TrailingContentArea role=\"complementary\" with a descriptive aria-label that reflects its content, such as \"Student details\"\n- Give each UtilityPanel a distinct aria-label: \"AI assistant\", \"Notifications\", or \"Filters\"\n- When a UtilityPanel opens, move focus into the panel; when it closes, return focus to the trigger that opened it"
msgstr "- Map zòn kontni prensipal la sou yon landmark &lt;main&gt; avèk yon lyen skip-nav pou itilizatè klavye ka sote GlobalNav\n- Bay ContentTabList role=\"navigation\" ak yon aria-label distenk tankou \"Page navigation\" — separe de landmark GlobalNav\n- Bay TrailingContentArea role=\"complementary\" ak yon aria-label deskriptif ki reflete kontni li, tankou \"Student details\"\n- Bay chak UtilityPanel yon aria-label distenk: \"AI assistant\", \"Notifications\", oswa \"Filters\"\n- Lè yon UtilityPanel louvri, deplase fokus andedan panèl la; lè li fèmen, retounen fokus sou trigger ki te louvri li"

