#: design/swatches/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Swatches are a flat reduction of the tokens to named colours, delivered *directly to a designer*\nto import into their tool. This is not an interchange format (use `@pantoken/dtcg` or\n`@pantoken/figma` for that) — it's a terminal palette file: Adobe ASE, GIMP `.gpl`, or Sketch\n`.sketchpalette`."
msgstr "Echantiyon yo se yon rediksyon senp nan tokens yo pou jwenn koulè ki gen non, delivre *direkteman bay yon designer*\npou enpòte nan zouti yo. Sa a se pa yon fòma echanj (itilize `@pantoken/dtcg` oswa\n`@pantoken/figma` pou sa) — se yon fichye palèt final: Adobe ASE, GIMP `.gpl`, oswa Sketch\n`.sketchpalette`."

