msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### prefix?"
msgstr "### prefix?"

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/ComponentOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The class prefix. A truthy string namespaces every class (`\"instui\"` → `.instui-button`); any\nfalsy value (`null`, `undefined`, `\"\"`, or omitting the option) drops the prefix entirely\n(`.button`), so you can author `class=\"heading -h1\"`. The stylesheets shipped by this package are\nbuilt with `\"instui\"`."
msgstr "Prefiks klas la. Yon chenn ki evalye kòm vérité mete chak klas nan yon namespace (`\"instui\"` → `.instui-button`); nenpòt\nvalè ki evalye kòm falsy (`null`, `undefined`, `\"\"`, oswa lè yo pa bay opsyon an) retire prefiks la nèt\n(`.button`), konsa ou ka ekri `class=\"heading -h1\"`. Fèy stil ki vini ak pake sa a\nyo konstwi ak `\"instui\"`."

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/ComponentOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### theme?"
msgstr "### theme?"

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/ComponentOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Target theme for emitted CSS. Defaults to `\"rebrand\"` when omitted."
msgstr "Tèm sib pou CSS ki pibliye. Li itilize `\"rebrand\"` kòm valè pa defo lè yo omèt li."

