msgid "Build a well-formed [Token](../interfaces/Token.md) from partial input, defaulting `syntax` to `\"*\"` and\n`inherits` to `true`. Plugins import this from `@pantoken/model` to avoid depending on\n`@pantoken/core`; for smart CSS syntax inference use `defineToken` from `@pantoken/core`."
msgstr "Konstwi yon byen fòme [Token](../interfaces/Token.md) soti nan antre patièl, lè pa defo mete `syntax` kòm `\"*\"` ak\n`inherits` kòm `true`. Plugin yo enpòte sa a soti nan `@pantoken/model` pou evite depann sou\n`@pantoken/core`; pou dediksyon entèlijan sentaks CSS sèvi ak `defineToken` soti nan `@pantoken/core`."

#: packages/model/src/index.md
