#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# plugin-kit"
msgstr "# plugin-kit"

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-kit` — build and compose pantoken plugins, with capability-aware registration."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-kit` — bati ak konpoze plugin pantoken, ak enskripsyon ki okouran de kapasite yo."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[definePlugin](functions/definePlugin.md) is the modern factory: pass the hooks you implement and it returns a normal\n`PantokenPlugin` branded with the capabilities inferred from those hooks. Consumers\n(`buildTokens`, `toCss`) run [checkPlugins](functions/checkPlugins.md) to warn — never error — when a plugin is\nregistered where it has no effect: a non-factoried plugin (capability checks unavailable) or a\nfactoried plugin at a stage it doesn't implement (e.g. a token-only plugin passed to `toCss`)."
msgstr "[definePlugin](functions/definePlugin.md) se faktori modèn nan: pase hooks ou enplemante epi li retounen yon `PantokenPlugin` nòmal ki make ak kapasite yo dedwi soti nan hooks sa yo. Konsomatè\n(`buildTokens`, `toCss`) kouri [checkPlugins](functions/checkPlugins.md) pou avèti — pa janm jete erè — lè yon plugin anrejistre kote li pa gen okenn efè: yon plugin ki pa pase pa faktori (tcheke kapasite pa disponib) oswa yon\nplugin faktorie nan yon etap li pa enplemante (eg. yon plugin sèlman-pou-token pase nan `toCss`)."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The transform stages a `plugins:` array actually drives are `tokens`, `icons`, and `css`; `rehype`\n(a render-time icon resolver) and `native` (Style Dictionary) are recorded as capabilities but are\ndownstream consumers, not guarded here."
msgstr "Etap transfòmasyon yon tablo `plugins:` aktyèlman kondwi se `tokens`, `icons`, ak `css`; `rehype`\n(yon rezolisè ikon lè rann) ak `native` (Style Dictionary) anrejistre kòm kapasite men se konsomatè ki vin apre nan pipe a, yo pa pwoteje isit la."

