#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# utils"
msgstr "# utils"

#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/utils` — shared, upstream-free helpers used across the pantoken packages: the token\nreference resolver (with `light-dark()` handling), the two token regexes (typed via `arkregex`),\nkebab→camel case, hex-colour parsing, SVG sanitization, the pantoken spacing scale, reference-drift\nvalidation, and the generic token→utility-class emitters that both `@pantoken/components`\n(semantic tier) and `@pantoken/plugin-primitives` (raw-palette tier) build on. Depends only on\n`@pantoken/model` (types) + `arkregex`, so any package can use it without pulling the GitHub-only\nupstream."
msgstr "`@pantoken/utils` — èd-jànm pataje, san depandans upstream, yo itilize atravè pake pantoken yo: rezolisyon referans token an (ak jesyon `light-dark()`), de regex token yo (tipaj via `arkregex`), konvèsyon kebab→camel case, analiz koulè hex, sanitizasyon SVG, echèl espas pantoken an, verifikasyon drift referans, ak emètè jeneral token→utility-class ke tou `@pantoken/components` (tèm semantik) ak `@pantoken/plugin-primitives` (tèm palèt-raw) bati sou yo. Depann sèlman sou `@pantoken/model` (tip) + `arkregex`, konsa nenpòt pake ka itilize li san li pa rale upstream ki sèlman sou GitHub."

#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The css-tree-backed token syntax validator lives at the separate `@pantoken/utils/token-syntax`\nentry, not this barrel — `css-tree` bundles a runtime `createRequire()` JSON load that breaks when\npulled into a browser/SSR bundle, and this barrel is imported by browser-facing packages (e.g.\n`@pantoken/components`) for the Node-free helpers above."
msgstr "Validatè sentaks token ki sèvi ak css-tree la rete nan antrepare separe `@pantoken/utils/token-syntax`, pa nan barèl sa a — `css-tree` pake yon chajman JSON `createRequire()` nan tan-kouri ki kraze lè li rale nan yon bundle navigatè/SSR, e pakè ki vize navigatè yo (egzanp `@pantoken/components`) enpòte barèl sa a pou èd-jànm Node-free ki dekri pi wo a."

#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A pure barrel — every implementation lives in its own discrete module; add new helpers there and\nre-export them here, don't grow this file."
msgstr "Yon barèl pwòp — chak enplemantasyon rete nan pwòp modil endepandan li; ajoute nouvo èd-jànm la epi re-eksporte yo isit la, pa grandi dosye sa a."

