msgstr "Fèy stil konpozan pou yon pè tèm/mòd bay (fèy tokèn plis seri konstan an)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# canvas-theme-editor"
msgstr "# canvas-theme-editor"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/canvas-theme-editor` — upload-ready `theme.css`/`theme.js` for Canvas LMS's Theme\nEditor, pre-wired to pantoken's CDN-hosted CSS. Consumed by `@pantoken/scaffold`'s\n`canvas-theme-editor` platform; also usable standalone."
msgstr "`@pantoken/canvas-theme-editor` — `theme.css`/`theme.js` pare pou telechaje pou Theme Editor nan Canvas LMS\n, pre-entegre ak CSS ki òspite sou CDN pantoken. Konsome pa platfòm `canvas-theme-editor` pou `@pantoken/scaffold`; kapab tou itilize kòm yon sèl-inite."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`THEME_CSS`/`THEME_JS` are the jsDelivr-default, unpinned output — use [buildTheme](functions/buildTheme.md) to\ntarget a different CDN provider, pin a version, or swap in other pantoken/third-party assets."
msgstr "`THEME_CSS`/`THEME_JS` se rezilta defo jsDelivr, ki pa fikse — itilize [buildTheme](functions/buildTheme.md) pou\nvize yon lòt founisè CDN, fikse yon vèsyon, oswa chanje ak lòt resous pantoken/oswa ki soti nan twazyèm pati."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: BuildThemeOptions"
msgstr "# Entèfas: BuildThemeOptions"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [buildTheme](../functions/buildTheme.md)/[buildThemeCss](../functions/buildThemeCss.md)/[buildThemeJs](../functions/buildThemeJs.md)."
msgstr "Opsyon pou [buildTheme](../functions/buildTheme.md)/[buildThemeCss](../functions/buildThemeCss.md)/[buildThemeJs](../functions/buildThemeJs.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### provider?"
msgstr "### provider?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CDN provider to build URLs for. Defaults to jsDelivr when omitted."
msgstr "Founisè CDN pou konstwi URL yo. Lè li pa bay, li itilize jsDelivr kòm valè pa defo."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### version?"
msgstr "### version?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pins the version for every asset below that doesn't specify its own `version`."
msgstr "Fikse vèsyon pou chak resous anba a ki pa presize pwòp `version` li."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Token theme variant. Defaults to `\"rebrand\"`. Ignored when `css` is supplied."
msgstr "Variant tèm token an. Valè pa defo se `\"rebrand\"`. Bliye lè `css` founi."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Rebrand token mode. Defaults to `\"light\"`. Ignored outside the `rebrand` theme, or when `css` is supplied."
msgstr "Mòd rebrand token. Valè pa defo se `\"light\"`. Pa konsidere l deyò tèm `rebrand`, oswa lè `css` founi."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### css?"
msgstr "### css?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Component-style sheets. Defaults to [defaultThemeCssAssets](../functions/defaultThemeCssAssets.md) for `theme`/`mode`."
msgstr "Fèy stil konpozan. Valè pa defo se [defaultThemeCssAssets](../functions/defaultThemeCssAssets.md) pou `theme`/`mode`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### fonts?"
msgstr "### fonts?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Font sheet(s). Defaults to [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_FONT\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_FONT_ASSETS.md)."
msgstr "Fèy polis(es). Valè pa defo se [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_FONT\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_FONT_ASSETS.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### js?"
msgstr "### js?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Script(s). Defaults to [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_JS\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_JS_ASSETS.md)."
msgstr "Script(s). Valè pa defo se [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_JS\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_JS_ASSETS.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### strings?"
msgstr "### strings?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Translated comment strings. Defaults to [ENGLISH\\_THEME\\_STRINGS](../variables/ENGLISH_THEME_STRINGS.md)."
msgstr "Kòd string kòm kòmantè tradui. Valè pa defo se [ENGLISH\\_THEME\\_STRINGS](../variables/ENGLISH_THEME_STRINGS.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: CdnFile"
msgstr "# Entèfas: CdnFile"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A single file to load from a CDN, identified by npm package name and path within it."
msgstr "Yon sèl fichye pou chaje soti nan yon CDN, idantifye pa non pake npm ak chemen an andedan li."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### package"
msgstr "### package"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The npm package name, e.g. `\"@pantoken/components\"`."
msgstr "Non pake npm lan, pa egzanp `\"@pantoken/components\"`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The path within the package, e.g. `\"dist/components.css\"`. Omit to reference the package root."
msgstr "Chemen an andedan pake a, pa egzanp `\"dist/components.css\"`. Pa mete li pou refere rasin pake a."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Overrides the provider/build-level version for this file only."
msgstr "Ranplase vèsyon founisè/nivo konstriksyon an pou fichye sa a sèlman."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### raw?"
msgstr "### raw?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For providers that transform JS by default (esm.sh): `false` lets the provider apply its normal\nESM transform (needed to `import` a real package entry point). Defaults to `true` — serve the\nfile verbatim, required for prebuilt/non-ESM assets like CSS sheets and IIFE bundles."
msgstr "Pou founisè ki transfòme JS pa defo (esm.sh): `false` pèmèt founisè a aplike transfòmasyon ESM nòmal li (sa nesesè pou `import` yon vrè pwen antre pake). Pa defo se `true` — sèvi fichye a verbatim, sa nesesè pou resous prekonpile/ki pa ESM tankou fichye CSS ak pakè IIFE."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: CdnProvider"
msgstr "# Entèfas: CdnProvider"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A CDN that can serve npm package files. Providers never hardcode a package name — they only\nknow how to shape a URL from a [CdnFile](CdnFile.md)."
msgstr "Yon CDN ki ka sèvi fichye pake npm. Founisè yo pa janm kode non pake a dirèkteman — yo sèlman konnen kijan pou fòme yon URL soti nan yon [CdnFile](CdnFile.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### id"
msgstr "### id"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stable identifier, e.g. `\"jsdelivr\"`."
msgstr "Idantifyan ki estab, eg. `\"jsdelivr\"`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### label"
msgstr "### label"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Human-readable name, e.g. `\"jsDelivr\"`."
msgstr "Non ki fasil pou moun li, eg. `\"jsDelivr\"`."

