msgstr "`@pantoken/hugo` — emèt fichye stil token Instructure pou yon sit Hugo."

#: platforms/hugo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hugo has no standard theming-variable contract, so this delivers the tokens as drop-in assets\nunder `assets/` (where Hugo Pipes / Dart Sass pick them up): a Sass partial and a plain CSS file\n(from `@pantoken/scss` and `@pantoken/css`), plus an InstUI-look prose stylesheet (from\n`@pantoken/components`) that styles content in a `.pantoken-prose` region."
msgstr "Hugo pa gen okenn kontra estanda pou varyab tèm, kidonk sa delivre token yo kòm resous drop-in\nsou `assets/` (kote Hugo Pipes / Dart Sass pran yo): yon partial Sass ak yon fichye CSS òdinè\n(soti nan `@pantoken/scss` ak `@pantoken/css`), plis yon fichye stil pwòz ak aparans InstUI (soti\nnan `@pantoken/components`) ki stilize kontni nan yon rejyon `.pantoken-prose`."

