#: platforms/jekyll/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Jekyll has no standard theming-variable contract, so this delivers the tokens as drop-in assets:\na Sass partial for `_sass/` (import it from your main stylesheet) and a plain CSS file for\n`assets/css/` (from `@pantoken/scss` and `@pantoken/css`), plus an InstUI-look prose stylesheet\n(from `@pantoken/components`) that styles content in a `.pantoken-prose` region."
msgstr "Jekyll pa gen yon kontra estanda pou varyab tèm, kidonk sa delivre token yo kòm resous 'drop-in':\nyon partial Sass pou `_sass/` (enpòte li soti nan fichye stil prensipal ou) ak yon fichye CSS senp pou\n`assets/css/` (soti nan `@pantoken/scss` ak `@pantoken/css`), plis yon fichye estil prose ak aparans InstUI\n(soti nan `@pantoken/components`) ki estile kontni nan yon zòn `.pantoken-prose`."

