#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: overlayColors()"
msgstr "# Fonksyon: overlayColors()"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Flatten `overlay` (at `percent`% strength) over an opaque `base` — a CSS-only stand-in for\nui-color-utils `overlayColors`. That helper source-over-composites two RGBA colors into one opaque\nresult; the common case (a translucent tint over a solid surface) is exactly a two-color\n`color-mix()`. General RGBA-over-RGBA compositing can't be a single CSS color, so this covers the\nopaque-base case only."
msgstr "Aplati `overlay` (nan fòs `percent`%) sou yon `base` opak — yon ranplasan sèlman CSS pou\nui-color-utils `overlayColors`. Ede sa a fè yon konpozisyon sous-sou ki konbine de koulè RGBA an yon rezilta opak; ka ki komen an (yon lonbraj translucent sou yon sifas solid) se egzakteman yon de-koulè\n`color-mix()`. Konpozisyon jeneral RGBA-sou-RGBA pa ka yon sèl koulè CSS, kidonk sa a kouvri sèlman ka baz opak la."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The opaque background color."
msgstr "Koulè background opak la."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### overlay"
msgstr "### overlay"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The color laid over it."
msgstr "Koulè ki plase sou li."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
