msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "InstUI's layout primitives (View, Flex, Grid, List, …) take `withVisualDebug` to outline the box\nand its children while debugging a layout. This plugin emits a single dash-prefixed modifier,\n`-with-visual-debug`, that works on any element (compound with any base, e.g.\n`.instui-view -with-visual-debug`). The outline colour is a `--pantoken-visual-debug-color` custom property\n(default a bright magenta) so it's easy to retint."
msgstr "Primitif layout InstUI yo (View, Flex, Grid, List, …) pran `withVisualDebug` pou trase kontou bwat la\nak pitit li yo pandan w ap débogaj yon layout. Plugin sa a jenere yon sèl modifikatè ki gen yon tirè-prefiks,\n`-with-visual-debug`, ki travay sou nenpòt eleman (konpoze ak nenpòt baz, pa egzanp\n`.instui-view -with-visual-debug`). Koulè kontou a se yon pwopriyete koutim `--pantoken-visual-debug-color`\n(defo yon magenta klere) kidonk li fasil pou retint."

