#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# flatten-property"
msgstr "# flatten-property"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-flatten-property` — convert `@property` at-rules to plain custom-property\ndeclarations."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-flatten-property` — konvèti `@property` at-rules an deklarasyon pwopriyete-custom\ndeklarasyon."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@property` at-rules register typed CSS custom properties with `syntax`, `inherits`, and\n`initial-value` descriptors. They carry significant byte overhead — ~60 bytes of boilerplate per\nproperty — and are unnecessary when the stylesheet is a self-contained bundle where type\nregistration provides no runtime benefit. This plugin replaces each `@property` block with a\nsimple `--name: value` declaration inside a chosen selector, recovering all that overhead."
msgstr "`@property` at-rules anrejistre pwopriyete koutim CSS tipifye ak deskriptè `syntax`, `inherits`, ak\n`initial-value`. Yo pote yon chaj konsiderab nan octets — ~60 bytes nan kod boilerplate pou chak\npwopriyete — epi yo pa nesesè lè fichye stil la se yon pake tèt ansanm kote anrejistreman tip pa bay okenn benefis nan tan kouri. Plugin sa a ranplase chak blòk `@property` ak yon\nsenp deklarasyon `--name: value` andedan yon selektè chwazi, rekipere tout chaj sa a."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Semantic note:** removing `@property` loses CSS type registration. Typed transitions/animations,\n`@starting-style`, and the CSS Typed OM depend on it. Only apply to bundles where those semantics\nare not needed."
msgstr "**Remak semantik:** retire `@property` fè w pèdi anrejistreman tip CSS. Transisyon/animasyon tipifye,\n`@starting-style`, ak CSS Typed OM depann sou li. Aplike sèlman sou pake kote semantik sa yo\npa nesesè."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: FlattenPropertyOptions"
msgstr "# Entèfas: FlattenPropertyOptions"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md)."
msgstr "Opsyon pou [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### injectSelector?"
msgstr "### injectSelector?"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The selector of the rule that receives the extracted `--name: value` declarations."
msgstr "Selektè règl la ki resevwa deklarasyon `--name: value` ekstrè yo."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "#### Default Value"
msgstr "#### Valè pa defo"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### onMissingInitialValue?"
msgstr "### onMissingInitialValue?"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "What to do with an `@property` at-rule that has no `initial-value` descriptor."
msgstr "Kisa pou fè ak yon at-rule `@property` ki pa gen deskriptè `initial-value`."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `\"remove\"` — drop the at-rule (default).\n- `\"keep\"` — leave it in the output untouched."
msgstr "- `\"remove\"` — retire at-rule la (pa defo).\n- `\"keep\"` — kite l nan sòti a san touche."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: flattenProperty"
msgstr "# Varyab: flattenProperty"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the flatten-`@property` PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "Kreye plugin PostCSS flatten-`@property`."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Walks all `@property` at-rules in the stylesheet, extracts each `initial-value` descriptor, removes\nthe at-rule, and prepends a single `injectSelector { --name: value; … }` rule containing all\nextracted declarations. Empty rules and `@layer` blocks left behind after removal are dropped."
msgstr "Li pase sou tout `@property` at-rules nan stylesheet la, ekstrè chak deskriptè `initial-value`, retire at-rule la, epi mete an tèt yon sèl règ `injectSelector { --name: value; … }` ki genyen tout deklarasyon yo ekstrè yo. Règ vid ak blòk `@layer` ki rete apre retire yo ap efase."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Default injection into :root**"
msgstr "**Enjeksyon pa default nan :root**"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Inject into :scope (for use inside scope blocks)**"
msgstr "**Enjekte nan :scope (pou itilize andedan blòk scope yo)**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# mangle-custom-props"
msgstr "# mangle-custom-props"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-mangle-custom-props` — rename long custom property names to minimal sequential\nidentifiers."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-mangle-custom-props` — renome non pwopriyete koutim long yo an idantifyan sekansyèl minimal\nidantifyan."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Token names like `--instui-component-alert-border-top-style` are human-readable but expensive in\nminified bundles: the name itself is 40+ bytes, repeated in the definition, every `var()` call,\nand every `@property` registration. This plugin replaces every matching name — across definitions,\n`var()` references, and `@property` params — with a minimal identifier (`--a`, `--b`, …, `--aa`,\n…), cutting name overhead by ~90%."
msgstr "Non token tankou `--instui-component-alert-border-top-style` fasil pou moun li men yo chè nan\npakè minifye: non an menm se plis pase 40 bytes, repete nan definisyon an, chak apèl `var()`,\nek chak enskripsyon `@property`. Plugin sa a ranplase chak non ki matche — atravè definisyon yo,\nreferans `var()`, ak paramèt `@property` — pa yon idantifyan minimal (`--a`, `--b`, …, `--aa`,\n…), sa diminye overhead non yo apeprè 90%."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Names are collected from the full stylesheet, sorted alphabetically for a deterministic mapping,\nthen assigned sequentially. A [MangleCustomPropsOptions.sharedManifest](interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md#sharedmanifest) option lets multiple\nseparate PostCSS passes share one consistent mapping, so separately processed CSS files that will\nbe loaded together can safely be mangled with the same names."
msgstr "Non yo ranmase soti nan tout fich style la, klase alfabetikman pou yon map deterministik,\nepi asiyen yo sekansyèlman. Yon opsyon [MangleCustomPropsOptions.sharedManifest](interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md#sharedmanifest) pèmèt plizyè\npas PostCSS separe pataje yon sèl map konsistan, konsa fichye CSS ki trete separeman e ki pral\nchaje ansanm ka modifye an sekirite ak menm non yo."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: MangleCustomPropsOptions"
msgstr "# Entèfas: MangleCustomPropsOptions"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."
msgstr "Opsyon pou [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only custom property names that start with this string are mangled."
msgstr "Sèlman non pwopriyete koutim ki kòmanse ak chèn sa a ki modifye."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### method?"
msgstr "### method?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The algorithm used to generate short replacement names."
msgstr "Algoritm ki itilize pou jenere non ranplasman kout."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `\"base26\"` — `--a`, `--b`, …, `--z`, `--aa`, `--ab`, … (default; shortest for large sets)\n- `\"base36\"` — `--0`, `--1`, …, `--9`, `--a`, …, `--z`, `--10`, … (alphanumeric)\n- `\"numeric\"` — `--0`, `--1`, `--2`, …"
msgstr "- `\"base26\"` — `--a`, `--b`, …, `--z`, `--aa`, `--ab`, … (pa defo; pi kout pou gwo seri)\n- `\"base36\"` — `--0`, `--1`, …, `--9`, `--a`, …, `--z`, `--10`, … (alfanimerik)\n- `\"numeric\"` — `--0`, `--1`, `--2`, …"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### propertyMap?"
msgstr "### propertyMap?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "When `true`, appends a `mangle-map` entry to PostCSS `result.messages` after processing.\nThe message has shape `{ type: \"mangle-map\", plugin: \"pantoken-mangle-custom-props\", map: Map<string, string> }`."
msgstr "Lè `true`, ajoute yon antre `mangle-map` nan PostCSS `result.messages` apre pwosesis.\nMesaj la gen fòm `{ type: \"mangle-map\", plugin: \"pantoken-mangle-custom-props\", map: Map<string, string> }`."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### sharedManifest?"
msgstr "### sharedManifest?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A mutable `Map` shared across multiple PostCSS passes."
msgstr "Yon `Map` ki chanje, pataje atravè plizyè pas PostCSS."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On each pass the plugin reads existing entries (reusing their short names) and writes new\nones (continuing the counter from `sharedManifest.size`). Pass the same `Map` instance to\nevery `mangleCustomProps` or `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files which will be\nloaded together in the browser — this guarantees all files use an identical name mapping."
msgstr "Nan chak pas plugin nan li antre ki egziste yo (li reutilize non kout yo) epi ekri nouvo yo (kontinye konte a soti nan `sharedManifest.size`). Pase menm egzanp `Map` la bay chak apèl `mangleCustomProps` oswa `applyMinify` ki pwosesis dosye CSS ki pral chaje ansanm nan navigatè a — sa garanti tout dosye yo sèvi ak menm kat non an."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Process the token sheet first so its names are seeded into the manifest before the component\nsheets add their (typically overlapping) references."
msgstr "Tretman fichye token an an premye pou non li yo plante nan manifest la anvan fichye konpozan yo ajoute referans yo (ki anjeneral sipèpoze)."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/type-aliases/MangleMethod.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Type Alias: MangleMethod"
msgstr "# Alyas tip: MangleMethod"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/type-aliases/MangleMethod.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Short-name generation strategy for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."
msgstr "Estrateji jenerasyon non kout pou [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: mangleCustomProps"
msgstr "# Varyab: mangleCustomProps"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the mangle-custom-properties PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "Kreye plugin PostCSS mangle-custom-properties la."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Collects all custom property names matching `prefix` from declaration props, `var()` references,\nand `@property` params. Sorts them alphabetically for a stable, deterministic mapping, then\nassigns short names using the chosen `method`. Replaces every occurrence throughout the stylesheet."
msgstr "Rasanble tout non pwopriyete personnalizé ki matche ak `prefix` soti nan deklarasyon props, `var()` referans,\nek param `@property`. Triye yo alfabetikman pou yon mapaj ki estab ak detèministik, epi\naisyen non kout lè l sèvi avèk `method` chwazi a. Ranplase chak aparisyon atravè tout fichye estil la."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle with defaults (--instui-\\*, base26)**"
msgstr "**Mangle ak valè pa defo (--instui-\\\\*, base26)**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Share the mapping across two files loaded together**"
msgstr "**Pataje mapaj la atravè de fichye ki chaje ansanm**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Use base36 names and emit the mapping via result.messages**"
msgstr "**Sèvi ak non base36 epi emèt mapaj la atravè result.messages**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: applyMinify()"
msgstr "# Fonksyon: applyMinify()"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply custom-property minification transforms to a stylesheet string."
msgstr "Aplike transfòmasyon minifikasyon pwopriyete-custom sou yon chèn stylesheet."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Builds a PostCSS plugin array from `options` and runs it synchronously. Plugin order:\n`pruneCustomProps` → `flattenProperty` → `mangleCustomProps`. Returns the input unchanged when\nno options are set."
msgstr "Konstwi yon tablo plugin PostCSS soti nan `options` epi kouri li an senkron. Lòd plugin yo:\n`pruneCustomProps` → `flattenProperty` → `mangleCustomProps`. Retounen antre a san chanjman lè\npa gen okenn opsyon ki mete."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The stylesheet string to transform."
msgstr "Chèn stylesheet pou transfòme."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The transformed CSS string."
msgstr "Chèn CSS transfòme a."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# props-minify"
msgstr "# props-minify"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — compose prune, flatten, and mangle transforms for\n`--instui-*` custom properties via a single [applyMinify](functions/applyMinify.md) utility."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — konpoze transfòmasyon prune, flatten, ak mangle pou\n`--instui-*` pwopriyete koutim atravè yon sèl itilite [applyMinify](functions/applyMinify.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each CSS-emitting pipeline (generate scripts, renderers) uses `applyMinify` for a consistent\nminification surface without taking a direct PostCSS dependency."
msgstr "Chak pipeline ki pwodwi CSS (generate scripts, renderers) itilize `applyMinify` pou yon sifas\nminifikasyon ki konsistan san yo pa pran yon depandans PostCSS dirèk."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Prune + mangle are only safe for self-contained bundles** where all `var(--instui-*)` references\nand their definitions live in the same output. For separate-file consumers (`@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/components` loaded independently), apply `{ flatten: true }` only."
msgstr "**Prune + mangle yo sèlman san danje pou pake ki izole tèt yo** kote tout referans `var(--instui-*)`\nak definisyon yo rete nan menm rezilta a. Pou konsomatè ki sèvi ak fichye separe (`@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/components` chaje endepandamman), aplike sèlman `{ flatten: true }`."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle across file boundaries:** pass the same `Map` instance as\n`mangle.sharedManifest` to every `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files loaded together.\nProcess the token sheet first (it seeds the manifest), then component sheets."
msgstr "**Mangle atravè limit fichye:** pase menm enstans `Map` la kòm\n`mangle.sharedManifest` bay chak apèl `applyMinify` ki trete fichye CSS yo ansanm.\nTretman fèy token an an premye (li ranpli manifest la), epi apre sa fèy konpozan yo."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Apply all three transforms to a self-contained bundle**"
msgstr "**Aplike twa transfòmasyon yo tout sou yon pake ki izole tèt li**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Flatten only (safe for separate-file consumers)**"
msgstr "**Sèlman flatten (san danje pou konsomatè ki itilize fichye separe)**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle two files with the same mapping**"
msgstr "**Mangle de fichye ak menm map la**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: PropsMinifyOptions"
msgstr "# Entèfas: PropsMinifyOptions"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [applyMinify](../functions/applyMinify.md)."
msgstr "Opsyon pou [applyMinify](../functions/applyMinify.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### prune?"
msgstr "### prune?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [pruneCustomProps](../variables/pruneCustomProps.md) to tree-shake unused `--instui-*` tokens before other transforms."
msgstr "Aplike [pruneCustomProps](../variables/pruneCustomProps.md) pou retire otomatikman `--instui-*` ki pa itilize anvan lòt transfòmasyon yo."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only safe for self-contained bundles that contain both token definitions and the component\nrules that reference them. Pruning a token-only sheet removes everything."
msgstr "Sèlman san danje pou pake ki endepandan ki gen tou de definisyon token ak règ konpozan\nki refere yo. Koupe yon fichye ki gen sèlman token retire tout bagay."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### flatten?"
msgstr "### flatten?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md) to convert `@property` at-rules to plain declarations."
msgstr "Aplike [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md) pou konvèti at-rules `@property` an deklarasyon senp."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`true` uses plugin defaults (`injectSelector: \":root\"`, `onMissingInitialValue: \"remove\"`).\nPass a [FlattenPropertyOptions](FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object to override individual defaults."
msgstr "`true` itilize defo plugin (`injectSelector: \":root\"`, `onMissingInitialValue: \"remove\"`).\nPase yon objè [FlattenPropertyOptions](FlattenPropertyOptions.md) pou ranplase chak defo."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### mangle?"
msgstr "### mangle?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md) to replace long `--instui-*` names with minimal identifiers."
msgstr "Aplike [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md) pou ranplase non `--instui-*` ki long ak idantifyan minim."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`true` uses plugin defaults (`prefix: \"--instui-\"`, `method: \"base26\"`).\nPass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to override individual defaults — including\n`sharedManifest` for cross-file coordination."
msgstr "`true` itilize defo plugin (`prefix: \"--instui-\"`, __PTK_INLINE_CODE_2%).\nPase yon objè [MangleCustomPropsOptions](MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) pou ranplase chak defo — enkli\n`sharedManifest` pou kowòdinasyon kwa-fichye."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only safe for self-contained bundles. See module-level docs."
msgstr "Sèlman san danje pou pake endepandan. Gade dokiman nivo modil la."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: pruneCustomProps"
msgstr "# Varyab: pruneCustomProps"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the prune-unused-custom-properties PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "Kreye plugin PostCSS prune-unused-custom-properties la."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Run it as a standalone PostCSS pass**"
msgstr "**Kouri li kòm yon pas PostCSS endepandan**"

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# prune-custom-props"
msgstr "# prune-custom-props"

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-prune-custom-props` — tree-shake unused custom properties from a composed\nstylesheet."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-prune-custom-props` — retire pwopriyete koutim ki pa itilize (tree-shake) soti nan yon fèy stil konpoze."

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "pantoken's `@pantoken/css` emits the whole `--instui-*` token set (≈1,800 icon data-URIs\nincluded). A renderer that builds on that layer but only styles a slice of the system would\notherwise ship the entire set — so any such renderer wants this. Starting from the `var()`\nreferences in real (non-custom-property) declarations, it transitively keeps only the custom\nproperties actually reachable, and drops the matching unused `@property` registrations."
msgstr "pantoken's `@pantoken/css` pibliye tout seri token `--instui-*` (≈1,800 icon data-URIs enkli). Yon renderer ki bati sou kouch sa a men ki sèlman stilize yon pati nan sistèm nan ta otreman voye tout seri a — kidonk nenpòt renderer konsa bezwen sa. Apati referans `var()` yo nan deklarasyon reyèl (ki pa custom-property), li tranzitivman kenbe sèlman pwopriyete koutim ki aktyèlman aksesib, epi li retire anrejistreman `@property` ki pa itilize yo."

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It's a standalone PostCSS plugin (run it in your own PostCSS pipeline). The factory returns a\nplain plugin object, so importing this module pulls in no runtime dependency — `postcss` is only\na type."
msgstr "Se yon plugin PostCSS endepandan (kouri li nan pwòp pipeline PostCSS ou). Faktori a retounen yon objè plugin senp, konsa enpòte modil sa a pa pote okenn depandans runtime — `postcss` se sèlman yon tip."

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pruneCustomProps](variables/pruneCustomProps.md)"
msgstr "Renome epi re-exporte [pruneCustomProps](variables/pruneCustomProps.md)"

