msgstr "**Konpoze rezolisè pou plugin brand-icon**"

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# markdown-it"
msgstr "# markdown-it"

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/markdown-it` — a markdown-it plugin that renders `:icon:` codes as inline SVG and\nstandalone color values (`#03893D`, `rgb(…)`, `oklch(…)`) as swatches, using the pantoken icon\nset."
msgstr "`@pantoken/markdown-it` — yon plugin markdown-it ki rann `:icon:` kòd kòm SVG anliy epi\nvalè koulè sèl (`#03893D`, `rgb(…)`, `oklch(…)`) kòm echantiyon koulè, lè l sèvi avèk seri ikon pantoken nan."

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It ports the `@pantoken/rehype` and `@pantoken/react-markdown` pipelines onto markdown-it: a\nsingle core rule walks each inline token's text children, splits them on the icon and color\npatterns, and swaps the matches for `html_inline` tokens. Icon codes resolve through a chain —\nplugin `rehype` resolvers first, then an explicit [MarkdownItOptions.resolve](interfaces/MarkdownItOptions.md#resolve), then the\nbuilt-in `@pantoken/icons` set — so brand-icon plugins compose the same way they do elsewhere."
msgstr "Li pòtede pipeline `@pantoken/rehype` ak `@pantoken/react-markdown` sou markdown-it: yon sèl règ nwayo mache sou chak timoun tèks token anliy, divize yo sou modèl ikon ak koulè, epi ranplase matche yo pa token `html_inline`. Kòd ikon rezoud atravè yon chèn — rezolvatè plugin `rehype` an premye, epi apre sa yon [MarkdownItOptions.resolve](interfaces/MarkdownItOptions.md#resolve) eksplisit, epi lè sa a seri entegre `@pantoken/icons` — kidonk plugin ikon mak yo konpoze menm jan yo fè lòt kote."

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The emitted markup uses the same class names as the other renderers (`pantoken-icon`,\n`pantoken-color-swatch`), so loading `@pantoken/components` styles it. Wrap the rendered HTML in a\n`.pantoken-prose` container (see [PROSE\\_CLASS](variables/PROSE_CLASS.md)) to pick up the prose layer too."
msgstr "Makup ki emèt la itilize menm non klas yo tankou lòt randeurè yo (`pantoken-icon`,\n`pantoken-color-swatch`), kidonk chaje `@pantoken/components` ap estil li. Anvlòp HTML rann lan nan yon\nkonteynè `.pantoken-prose` (gade [PROSE\\_CLASS](variables/PROSE_CLASS.md)) pou li pran kouch pwòp tèks la tou."

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
