msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wrap component rules in `@scope` for DOM containment (default `true`)."
msgstr "Anbalaj règ konpozan yo nan `@scope` pou konfinman DOM (valè pa defo `true`)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### important?"
msgstr "### important?"

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add `!important` to component declarations so they beat Pendo's styles (default `true`)."
msgstr "Ajoute `!important` nan deklarasyon konpozan yo pou yo bat stil Pendo yo (valè pa defo `true`)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tree-shake unused `--instui-*` tokens (default `true`; off ships the full token set)."
msgstr "Retire pyès (tree-shake) token `--instui-*` ki pa itilize yo (valè pa defo `true`; si dezaktive, li anbake tout seri token yo)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Convert `@property` at-rules to plain custom-property declarations via\n[flattenProperty](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md) (default `false`). `true` uses plugin defaults with\n`injectSelector: \":scope\"` so the declarations land inside the `@scope` block.\nPass a [FlattenPropertyOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object to override individual defaults."
msgstr "Konvèti règleman `@property` at-rules yo an deklarasyon pwopriyete-custom senp atravè\n[flattenProperty](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md) (valè pa defo `false`). `true` itilize valè pa defo plugin la ak\n`injectSelector: \":scope\"` konsa deklarasyon yo parèt andedan blòk `@scope` la.\nPase yon objè [FlattenPropertyOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md) pou ranplase defo endividyèl yo."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mangle `--instui-*` names to minimal base-26 identifiers via [mangleCustomProps](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md)\n(default `false`). Safe here because the full token + component stylesheet is a\nself-contained bundle. Pass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to override defaults."
msgstr "Konvèti non `--instui-*` yo an idantifyan minimòm baz-26 atravè [mangleCustomProps](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md)\n(valè pa defo `false`). Sa san danje isit la paske stylesheet konplè token + konpozan an se yon\npakèt ki fonksyone poukont li. Pase yon objè [MangleCustomPropsOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) pou ranplase defo yo."

