msgid "Validate a pantoken class token (e.g., \"instui-button\", \"instui-button.-color-primary\").\nReturns an array of validation errors (empty if valid)."
msgstr "Valide yon token klas pantoken (pa egzanp, \"instui-button\", \"instui-button.-color-primary\").\nRetounen yon tablo erè validasyon (vid si li valab)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# tinymce"
msgstr "# tinymce"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: CssDocEntry"
msgstr "# Entèfas: CssDocEntry"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One documented CSS record: its base class plus everything derived from the CSS + doc comments."
msgstr "Youn dosye CSS dokimante: klas baz li ansanm ak tout sa ki sòti nan CSS + kòmantè dokimantasyon yo."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The record name from `@component`/`@utility`/`@rule`/`@declaration`/`@name`, e.g. `button`."
msgstr "Non dosye a soti nan `@component`/`@utility`/`@rule`/`@declaration`/`@name`, e.g. `button`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### kind"
msgstr "### kind"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Which kind of CSS surface this documents (defaults to `component`)."
msgstr "Ki kalite sifas CSS dokimante sa a ye (default se `component`)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base CSS selector — a class (`.button`), attribute (`[data-layout=\"x\"]`), ID (`#foo`),\n or shadow-DOM pseudo (`:host`) — inferred from the first bare-class rule or set explicitly via\n `@selector`. Always non-empty (falls back to `.${name}` when inference fails)."
msgstr "Selektè CSS baz la — yon klas (`.button`), atribi (`[data-layout=\"x\"]`), ID (`#foo`),\n oswa pseudo shadow-DOM (`:host`) — dedwi soti nan premye règ bare-class la oswa fikse eksplisitman via\n `@selector`. Toujou pa vid (retounen sou `.${name}` lè enfèrans echwe)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### summary?"
msgstr "### summary?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One-line summary from `@summary`."
msgstr "Rezime yon liy soti nan `@summary`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### remarks?"
msgstr "### remarks?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Extended prose from `@remarks`."
msgstr "Pwosè elaji soti nan `@remarks`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### privateRemarks?"
msgstr "### privateRemarks?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Internal-only prose from `@privateRemarks` (emitters may choose to omit it from public output)."
msgstr "Tèks pou itilizasyon entèn sèlman soti nan `@privateRemarks` (emitè yo ka chwazi pa enkli li nan rezilta piblik)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### releaseStage?"
msgstr "### releaseStage?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The release stage from a modifier flag tag (`@alpha`/`@beta`/`@experimental`/`@internal`/`@public`)."
msgstr "Nivo lage a soti nan yon tag drapo modifikatè (`@alpha`/`@beta`/`@experimental`/`@internal`/`@public`)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### since?"
msgstr "### since?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Version introduced, from `@since`."
msgstr "Vèsyon kote li te entwodui, soti nan `@since`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### group?"
msgstr "### group?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A documentation group/category, from `@group`/`@category`."
msgstr "Yon gwoup/kategori dokimantasyon, soti nan `@group`/`@category`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### accessibility?"
msgstr "### accessibility?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Accessibility guidance, from `@a11y`/`@accessibility`."
msgstr "Gid aksèbilite, soti nan `@a11y`/`@accessibility`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### global?"
msgstr "### global?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Set when this record carries a `@global` tag — its modifiers (and per-modifier `@global` flags)\napply to any component/layout/rule/declaration, not just this record's base class. Used during\nvalidation and consumption checks to resolve modifier matches globally."
msgstr "Mete lè dosye sa pote yon tag `@global` — modifikatè li yo (ak drapo pou chak-modifikatè `@global`) aplike a nenpòt konpozan/konpozisyon/règ/deklare, pa sèlman klas baz dosye sa a. Itilize pandan\nvalidasyon ak chèk konsomasyon pou rezoud matche modifikatè globalman."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### modifiers"
msgstr "### modifiers"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "AST-extracted modifiers, annotated with `@modifier` prose where authored."
msgstr "Modifikatè ekstrè soti nan AST la, anote ak `@modifier` tèks kote yo te ekri."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### parts"
msgstr "### parts"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "AST-extracted sub-element parts (class-based), annotated with `@part` prose where authored."
msgstr "Pati sib-eleman ekstrè soti nan AST la (ki baze sou klas)), anote ak `@part` tèks kote yo te ekri."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### shadowParts"
msgstr "### shadowParts"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Shadow-DOM exposed parts (`::part(name)`), from `@csspart` or a `::part()` selector."
msgstr "Patisyon ekspoze pa Shadow-DOM (`::part(name)`), soti nan `@csspart` oswa yon selektè `::part()`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### pseudoElements"
msgstr "### pseudoElements"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Native pseudo-elements the component styles (`::before`, `::marker`, …), from `@pseudo` or a selector."
msgstr "Pseudo-eleman natif-natal estil konpozan an (`::before`, `::marker`, …), soti nan `@pseudo` oswa yon selektè."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### states"
msgstr "### states"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "States the component reacts to, from `@cssstate`, `:state()`, pseudo-classes, or state classes."
msgstr "Eta konpozan an reponn a yo, soti nan `@cssstate`, `:state()`, pseudo-classes, oswa klas eta."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### slots"
msgstr "### slots"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Named slots the component shell exposes, from `@slot`."
msgstr "Slot ki gen non ke kich la ekspoze, soti nan `@slot`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### elements?"
msgstr "### elements?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Allowed HTML elements from `@element` (default + optional named profiles)."
msgstr "Eleman HTML ki pèmèt soti nan `@element` (defo + pwofil nonmen opsyonèl)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### todos"
msgstr "### todos"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Internal to-do notes, from `@todo` tags and `/* @todo … */` inline comments. Development notes,\nnot public API — emitters may omit them (like [CssDocEntry.privateRemarks](#privateremarks))."
msgstr "Nòt entèns travay-a-fè, soti nan `@todo` tags ak `/* @todo … */` kòmantè inline. Nòt devlopman,\npa API piblik — emitè yo ka pa enkli yo (tankou [CssDocEntry.privateRemarks](#privateremarks))."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### cssPropertiesConsumed"
msgstr "### cssPropertiesConsumed"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Design tokens this component consumes: every `--*` custom property referenced via `var(...)` inside\nits rules, each annotated with `@tokens` prose where authored (and including any `@tokens`-declared\ntoken not literally found via `var()`)."
msgstr "Tokens konsepsyon konpozan sa a konsome: chak `--*` pwopriyete koutim refere atravè `var(...)` andedan\nrèg li yo, chak anote ak `@tokens` tèks kote yo te ekri (epi enkli nenpòt `@tokens`-deklae\ntoken ki pa literalman jwenn via `var()`)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### cssPropertiesDeclared"
msgstr "### cssPropertiesDeclared"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Custom properties this component declares (`@property`) or documents (`@cssproperty`)."
msgstr "Pwopriyete koutim konpozan sa a deklare (`@property`) oswa dokimante (`@cssproperty`)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### functions"
msgstr "### functions"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "CSS custom functions (`@function`) this component defines."
msgstr "Fonksyon koutim CSS (`@function`) ke konpozan sa a defini."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### animations"
msgstr "### animations"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animations (`@keyframes`) this component exposes."
msgstr "Animasyon (`@keyframes`) ke konpozan sa a ekspoze."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### layers"
msgstr "### layers"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Cascade layers (`@layer`) this component participates in."
msgstr "Kouch kaskad (`@layer`) ke konpozan sa a patisipe ladanl."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### conditions"
msgstr "### conditions"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Conditional-support blocks (`@container`/`@supports`/`@media`) the rules sit under."
msgstr "Blòk sipò kondisyonèl (`@container`/`@supports`/`@media`) anba ki règ yo chita."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### examples"
msgstr "### examples"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@example` blocks, verbatim."
msgstr "`@example` blòk, vèbatim."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### structure?"
msgstr "### structure?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The authored `@structure` element tree (top-level nodes), when present. When the `@structure` body\nuses `@variant` blocks (see [structureVariants](#structurevariants)), this holds the first variant's nodes only,\nfor back-compat with any code that hasn't been updated to read `structureVariants`."
msgstr "Pyebwa eleman otè a ekri a `@structure` (nœuds tèt-nivo), lè prezan. Lè kò a `@structure` itilize `@variant` blòk (gade [structureVariants](#structurevariants)), sa a kenbe nœuds premye varyant lan sèlman,\npou konpatibilite bak ak nenpòt kòd ki poko mete ajou pou li li `structureVariants`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### structureVariants?"
msgstr "### structureVariants?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alternative DOM shapes for this component, when the authored `@structure` body contains one or\nmore top-level `@variant` blocks — absent for the common case of a single, non-variant structure."
msgstr "Fòm DOM altènatif pou konpozan sa a, lè kò otè a `@structure` gen youn oswa\nplis blòk tèt-nivo `@variant` — absan pou ka komen kote gen yon sèl estrikti san varyant."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### structureDescription?"
msgstr "### structureDescription?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An optional prose description leading the `@structure` body, when authored."
msgstr "Yon deskripsyon pwosè opsyonèl ki mennen kò `@structure`, lè li ekri."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### demo?"
msgstr "### demo?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@demo <spec>` (e.g. `self:button`), when authored."
msgstr "`@demo &lt;spec&gt;` (e.g. `self:button`), when authored."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Component-level deprecation replacement text, when authored (the argument to a `@deprecated` tag)."
msgstr "Tèks ranplasman deprekasyo nivo konpozan, lè li ekri (agiman pou yon tag `@deprecated`)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### see"
msgstr "### see"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@see <ref>` cross-references."
msgstr "`@see &lt;ref&gt;` cross-references."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### usage?"
msgstr "### usage?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Usage prose from `@usage` — how to include the stylesheet / use the component."
msgstr "Pwosè itilizasyon soti nan `@usage` — kijan pou enkli fichyè stil la / itilize konpozan an."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### annotations"
msgstr "### annotations"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Local annotation legend rows from `@annotations`, in author order."
msgstr "Ranje lejand anotasyon lokal soti nan `@annotations`, nan lòd otè a."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### refs"
msgstr "### refs"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Local annotation references from `@ref`, in author order."
msgstr "Referans anotasyon lokal soti nan `@ref`, nan lòd otè a."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### decorators"
msgstr "### decorators"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Record-level object-model decorators."
msgstr "Dekoratè modèl-objè nan nivo dosye a."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### compat"
msgstr "### compat"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Browser-support / feature-compatibility notes from `@compat`."
msgstr "Nòt sipò navigatè / konpatibilite karakteristik soti nan `@compat`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### related"
msgstr "### related"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Related components from `@related`."
msgstr "Konpozan ki gen rapò soti nan `@related`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### memberOf?"
msgstr "### memberOf?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Declared family membership from `@memberOf` — this record is a member of another named record,\noptionally `private` (must only ever appear inside that parent). Absent when not authored."
msgstr "Membreship fanmi deklare soti nan `@memberOf` — dosye sa a se yon manm yon lòt dosye nonmen,\nopsyonèlman `private` (dwe parèt sèlman andedan paran sa a). Absan lè pa otè."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### members?"
msgstr "### members?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Member record names from `@members` — the inverse direction, declared on the parent."
msgstr "Non dosye manm soti nan `@members` — direksyon envès, deklare sou paran an."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### memberDeclarations?"
msgstr "### memberDeclarations?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Structured parent-side member declarations from repeated `@member` tags."
msgstr "Deklarasyon manm estriktire sou bò paran an soti nan repete tag `@member`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Where the record was authored, when position info is available (for source links)."
msgstr "Kote dosye a te ekri, lè enfòmasyon pozisyon disponib (pou lyen sous))."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### customBlocks?"
msgstr "### customBlocks?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Content of registered custom (block) tags, keyed by tag name without its `@`. Populated only for\ntags added via configuration; unregistered unknown tags are ignored. Absent when none were found."
msgstr "Kontni tag koutim (blòk) ki anrejistre yo, endèks pa non tag la san `@`. Ranpli sèlman pou\ntag yo ajoute atravè konfigirasyon; tag enkoni ki pa anrejistre yo inyore. Pa prezan lè pa gen okenn ki te jwenn."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/LayoutsPluginOptions.md
#, no-c-format
