msgid "Build a `WebComponentStrings` object for `locale`.\nWeekday names are derived from `Intl.DateTimeFormat` (and rotated to the locale's first day of\nweek); all other strings fall back to English unless provided in `overrides`."
msgstr "Konstwi yon objè `WebComponentStrings` pou `locale`.\nNon jou yo nan semèn nan sòti nan `Intl.DateTimeFormat` (epi vire selon premye jou nan\nsemèn pou lokal la); tout lòt chenn retounen an Angle si yo pa bay yo nan `overrides`."

