msgstr "Yon rezolutè fòm [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) ki pa janm rezoud anyen — pou eleman ki pa bezwen li."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Accepts a fully resolved [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) *or* a raw BCP47 tag string. When a string is\npassed, [makeStrings](makeStrings.md) derives weekday names via `Intl.DateTimeFormat` and all other strings\nfall back to English; pass a bundle for full translations."
msgstr "Asepte yon [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) ki konplètman rezoud *oswa* yon chèn tag BCP47 an kri. Lè yon chèn\npase, [makeStrings](makeStrings.md) sòti non jou semèn yo atravè `Intl.DateTimeFormat` epi tout lòt chèn\nretounen nan Angle; pase yon bundle pou tradiksyon konplè."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) object, or a BCP47 tag (`\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, …)."
msgstr "Yon objè [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md), oswa yon tag BCP47 (`\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, …)."

