#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# web-components"
msgstr "# web-components"

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/web-components` — framework-agnostic custom elements for Instructure UI."
msgstr "`@pantoken/web-components` — eleman koutim ki pa depann sou okenn framework pou Instructure UI."

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[register](functions/register.md) (auto-invoked in the browser) defines the full `<instui-*>` element set into\nany custom-element registry. Each element renders the matching `@pantoken/components` CSS into\nits shadow root; tokens are inherited custom properties that pierce the shadow boundary — load\n`@pantoken/css` to supply them."
msgstr "[register](functions/register.md) (rele otomatikman nan navigatè a) defini tout seri eleman `<instui-*>` la nan\nnenpot rejis eleman koutim. Chak eleman rann CSS `@pantoken/components` ki koresponn nan nan\nshadow root li; tokens se pwopriyete koutim erite ki travèse limit shadow la — chaje\n`@pantoken/css` pou bay yo."

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For localized UI strings (calendar nav labels, date-input placeholder, drilldown Back text) pass\n`locale`, `strings`, or `dir` options to [register](functions/register.md). The full Canvas-parity bundle set and\nthe [registerLocalized](functions/registerLocalized.md) helper are exported from this package as well."
msgstr "Pou chenn UI lokalize (etikèt navigasyon kalandriye, placeholder pou antre dat, tèks Back nan drilldown) pase\n`locale`, `strings`, oswa `dir` kòm opsyon bay [register](functions/register.md). Seri bundle konplè ki gen parite ak Canvas la ak\n[registerLocalized](functions/registerLocalized.md) helper la exporte tou soti nan pake sa a."

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The module is Node-safe: element classes are defined inside [register](functions/register.md), a no-op when there\nis no DOM, so importing during SSR or a build never touches `HTMLElement`."
msgstr "Modil la sekirize pou Node: klas eleman yo defini anndan [register](functions/register.md), yon no-op lè pa gen DOM, kidonk enpòte li pandan SSR oswa yon build p ap janm manyen `HTMLElement`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/ElementDefinition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: ElementDefinition"
msgstr "# Entèfas: ElementDefinition"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/ElementDefinition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One registered custom element: its base tag name plus a `define` that registers it via the context."
msgstr "Yon eleman koutim anrejistre: non tag baz li ansanm ak yon `define` ki anrejistre li atravè kontèks la."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/ElementDefinition.md
