msgstr "### pkg"

#: tools/aggregate/src/interfaces/Target.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The package name, e.g. `@pantoken/astro`."
msgstr "Non pake a, pa egzanp `@pantoken/astro`."

#: tools/aggregate/src/interfaces/Target.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### key"
msgstr "### key"

#: tools/aggregate/src/interfaces/Target.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The aggregation key / export name, e.g. `astro`."
msgstr "Kle agregasyon / non ekspòtasyon an, pa egzanp `astro`."

#: tools/aggregate/src/interfaces/Target.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "How the target is exposed:\n- `namespace` — re-exported into the eager barrel *and* as a subpath.\n- `sideEffect` — subpath imports the package's `/inject` entry; also in the barrel.\n- `subpath` — subpath only, kept OUT of the eager barrel (for heavy peers like React, so\n  `import \"pantoken\"` never loads them)."
msgstr "Kijan sib la ekspoze:\n- `namespace` — re-eksporte nan barèl eager *epi* kòm yon subpath.\n- `sideEffect` — subpath la enpòte antre `/inject` pake a; li tou prezan nan barèl la.\n- `subpath` — sèlman subpath, kenbe DEYO nan barèl eager la (pou parèy lou tankou React, konsa\n  `import \"pantoken\"` pa janm chaje yo)."

