#: tools/demo/src/variables/FULLSCREEN_BUTTON_HTML.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: FULLSCREEN\\_BUTTON\\_HTML"
msgstr "# Varyab: FULLSCREEN\\_BUTTON\\_HTML"

#: tools/demo/src/variables/FULLSCREEN_BUTTON_HTML.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A hoverable \"view fullscreen\" button, overlaid on a demo/example frame the same way VitePress's own\ncode-block \"copy\" button reveals on hover. Purely markup — wire a delegated click handler in your\nhost page (`button.closest(...).querySelector(\"iframe\")?.requestFullscreen()`; see the pantoken docs\ntheme for the reference wiring) and style the reveal-on-hover with `@pantoken/demo/demo.css`."
msgstr "Yon bouton \"view fullscreen\" ki parèt lè w pase sourit la sou li, kouvri yon kad demo/egzanp menm jan bouton \"copy\" VitePress la sou code-block parèt lè w pase sourit la. Se sèlman makaj — konekte yon gestionè klik delege sou paj òt ou (`button.closest(...).querySelector(\"iframe\")?.requestFullscreen()`; gade tèm dokiman pantoken pou fil koneksyon referans la) epi stilize aparisyon-lè-pase-sourit la ak `@pantoken/demo/demo.css`."

