msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The localized wordmark's language, if a translated variant is wanted."
msgstr "Lang wordmark lokalize a, si yo vle yon varyant tradui."

msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The localized wordmark's language, absent for the default (English) variant."
msgstr "Lang wordmark lokalize a; li pa prezan pou varyant default la (Angle)."

msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A trailing language code on a localized wordmark variant, e.g. `\"horizontal-full-color-ar\"`."
msgstr "Yon kòd lang ki mete nan fen yon varyant wordmark lokalize, pa egzanp `\"horizontal-full-color-ar\"`."

msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "BCP47 locale tag or a pre-built [LocaleBundle](#). When set, uses `registerLocalized`."
msgstr "Tag lokal BCP47 oswa yon [LocaleBundle](#) deja konstwi. Lè li mete, li itilize `registerLocalized`."

msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Accepts a fully resolved [LocaleBundle](#) *or* a raw BCP47 tag string. When a string is\npassed, [makeStrings](#) derives weekday names via `Intl.DateTimeFormat` and all other strings\nfall back to English; pass a bundle for full translations."
msgstr "Aksepte yon [LocaleBundle](#) ki konplètman rezoud *oswa* yon chenn tag BCP47 kri. Lè yo pase yon chenn, [makeStrings](#) sòti non jou semèn yo atravè `Intl.DateTimeFormat` epi tout lòt chenn retounen nan Angle; pase yon bundle pou tradiksyon konplè."

msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [LocaleBundle](#) object, or a BCP47 tag (`\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, …)."
msgstr "Yon objè [LocaleBundle](#), oswa yon tag BCP47 (`\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, …)."

msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Defines the uniform plugin contract ([PantokenPlugin](interfaces/PantokenPlugin.md)) and adapts the resolved token IR for\nthe native lineage ([toStyleDictionary](functions/toStyleDictionary.md)). The upstream-resolving transform (`buildTokens`,\nwhich needs the GitHub-only `@instructure/instructure-design-tokens`) lives on the separate\n`@pantoken/core/build` entry so this main entry stays free of that exotic dependency."
msgstr "Defini kontra inifòm plugin la ([PantokenPlugin](interfaces/PantokenPlugin.md))) epi adapte IR token rezoud la pou\nthe native lineage ([toStyleDictionary](functions/toStyleDictionary.md))). Transfòmasyon ki rezoud sous la (`buildTokens`,\nki bezwen `@instructure/instructure-design-tokens`)) ap rezide sou antre separe\n`@pantoken/core/build`, konsa antre prensipal sa a rete lib de depandans ekzotik sa a."
